<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">DEUTERONOMY</para>
  <para style="toc1">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="toc2">DEUTERONOMY</para>
  <para style="toc3">Deu</para>
  <para style="mt1">DEUTERONOMY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Deuteronomy</char> ccauh kyahin Israel hae nynh ramkaw kya myarya sawpaw mih laanccia athangnaw kya Kanaan ram vyavya a teedyn hae, Moab ram kya a um lya hae ze Moses nynh Israel minphuin hae a hopya hae paw bya kha a zei hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh kya abyapi huaccepaw akonglang hae tuh akawlan thyhte nynh thua: (1) Moses nynh langmawlya kum sung pali lungkhu abyapihua lante acyihkuhpaw kha bua a hopya hae. Ramkaw kya a ccia lya hae ze Pachia nynh a cciakhaenaw hae kong kha a liathui nawlan hae te Pachia tungvaw kawngaenaw te lungzinaw a hoi nawlan hae a hopya hae. (2) Moses nynh Kawbya Ccanghaw kha bua hopah hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyalya kha na beik cih oh, cikuhpaw Kawbya Ccangkheitnaw asuilan kha a ccaesahpya hae. Israel hae nynh Kanaan ram lungkhu a tee hae te a zui lan hae paw phungbya aphuinphuin kha a hopya hae. (3) Pachia nynh minmin ryte a raepaw byakinnaw asuilan kha Moses nynh bua nysah hae zah, mih byakinnaw te a cyi lan hae paw kha athaw lante bua a hopya hae. (4) Joshua tuh Pachia ccungccaw hae cciakhaetu lang Moses koute he a zuitu lang khang athua. Pachia a lungzinaw kong kha hlawsah zah Israel phin hae kha hythua a pya kou hae te Moses tuh Jordan Vaw nithua lang umpaw Moab ram kya a chih.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pachia nynh a sungsahpaw a ccungccaw hae kha khum hae zah hythua a pya hae; a ccungccaw hae nynh hiinnaw hoi hae zah hythuanaw po a ccou nawlan hae, tuh-e tuh a liathui cih hae zah amaw kha a sungsah lan hae paw te a kaw a ngae lan hae paw nynh thua, cipaw tuh e ccauh abyalupi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh kyaze tohccung hawte abyapi huapaw byatue tuh 6.4-6 lungkhu a umpaw hynh thua zah, Jesu nynh kawbya balyn kyaze ale huapaw a cipaw: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na thinlung balyn te, na tuanaw balyn te, na thawzung balyn te na sungsah cih,” a cikuhpaw kha nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses nynh masaty byahopaw 1.1—4.49</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses nynh vae ningnaw byahopaw 5.1—26.19</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Kawbya Ccanghaw 5.1—10.22</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Phungbya hae, phunglang hae te raeringnaw pyanaw 11.1—26.19</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanaan ram lang teenaw zia ccangpyanaw 27.1—28.68</para>
  <para style="io1">Byakinnaw thawsahthuinaw 29.1—30.20</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses rhohui bya 31.1—33.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses chinaw 34.1-12</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Horeb kya Acyihkuhpaw Hothuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e tuh Moses nynh Israel hae balyn kalan Paran te Tofel, Laban, Hazeroth te Dizahab alaku, Suf te arawsekunaw bialae kya, Jordan vaw akhung lang ramkaw khe a hopya hae paw bya nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />(Horeb kyate Kadesh-barnea lang tuh Seir Mua laanpi lang te nin haw lae kheit laanccia nynh thua.) <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sung palinaw kum, sawpaw sah haw lae kheitnaw kyaze masaty nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kya Israel hae hopya khylan kaw a pya thyhte Moses nynh Israel hae kha a hopya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />E hynh Heshbon kya umpaw Amor Siapharan Sihon te Ashtaroth te Edrei kya umpaw Bashan Siapharan Og kha Moses nynh a tae kou hae te nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan vaw akhung lang, Moab ram khe Moses nynh hynh-e upadi hynh akawlan thyhte a hopya hae:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh Horeb kya aening oun hopyapaw tuh, “E mua kya khaw cia na um vae oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Cceih oh lah, mua alungnaw Amor hae ram lungkhu lang te a pepan umpaw ram hae Arabah lang thuasah, mua alungnaw ram lang thuasah, Shefelah lang thuasah, Negeb te rili kin lang thuasah, Kanaan hae ram te Lebanon lang thuasah Zufrates vawpi cia cceih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Dotua oh, ram tuh nae malang ka nung vae; nae minpaaw hae Abraham, Isak te Jakob kalan te minmin koute mih ciihan hae kalan pya lan bya ka kinkupaw ram lungkhu lang tee oh lah, ram nynh a hoipaw kha lawkuh oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Phin Cciakhaetu hae Khangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Exo 18.13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze kae nynh nanning kha, “Ka makhaete tuh nae hanlan ka taening lan khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pungthungsah oh zah, atunin nanning tuh vaawlui e awsi zeih na cih vae oh. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> athuapaw nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku thyh oh te, leit thong kheit ae lungthungsah oh sah lah, hythua ae pya vae oh sah! <verse number="12" style="v" />Bya na lung oh paw aripaw ryalaw balyn hynh ka makhaete pawtemou ka phu kho cih? <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning ae cciakhae lan oh paw, nae phin kyaze a hawpaw, a nyhthyapaw te sawtua lan umpaw lu kheit cci kha pokuh oh,” cite kae hopya oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh kae kha, “Na hopaw tuh ahoypaw nynh thua,” nae cipya oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae phin kya-e cciakhaetu hae, ahawpaw te sawtua lan umpaw kha ka ko hae zah, athong uktu hae, aza uktu hae, sung pangaw uktu hae, lu haw uktu hae te bawi hae lang nae phin takyh kya ka nung hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze nae byapiatu hae kha ka khang hae: “Nae phu kya-e ccungccaw hae bya kha hoyte piapah oh lah, ramccungccaw thuasah, ramccang ccungccaw thuasah lu kheit te lu kheit laku ahmete byapia oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Maedote bya na pia lan khyh oh: mino te piccan phe lokuh lante bya na piapah cih oh; ccungccaw nynh nangsekunaw kha na rih lan khyh oh, pawccecize byapianaw tuh Pachia kya-e nynh thua. Nanning hanlan myarya rupaw bya tuh ka kalan yn thuakhae oh, kamaw nynh ka pia cih,” a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze na cyi lan oh paw atyn-are balyn kha kae hopya oh, a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh Ram kya Tee lan A Ei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Nam 13.1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh kaw oun pya thyhte, Horeb kyate ah cceih oh zah, na muih vae oh hawte myarya lepaw te ri lan umpaw ramkaw balyn, mua alungnaw Amor hae ram lang cceihpaw laanpi khate Kadesh-barnea kyacia ah thua oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kae nynh nanning kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh oun pyapaw, mua alungnaw Amor hae ram na thua vae oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Dotua oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha ram ae pya vae oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> athuapaw nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh paw ram lang cceihthung oh lah lawkuh oh; rih nan oh lah, nae lungthang nan sah,” kae cipya oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nanning balyn nynh kamaw kalan nae cceih oh zah, “Aening hanlan ram oun dopah cih paw ccungccaw hae kha saw oh sih lah, ah ccianua cih oh paw khuapi hae te ah cciathung nawlan oh paw laanpi kong kha oun hopah hae sah,” na ci oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh ahoypaw ka losah zah nanning lu haw lae ning kha phin kheit cci kyate lu kheit cci kae po oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh cceih hae zah mua alungnaw ram lungkhu lang a cceihthung hae, te Eshkol Vahue kya he a thua hae te, ram kha a dophi hae, <verse number="25" style="v" />tuh-e ram kya-e apoupaw thingthae abang kha suelua hae zah aening kalan oun cciakhae bung hae. Minmin nynh thongpang oun phupah hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh oun pyapaw ram tuh ahoypaw ram nynh thua,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh na cceihthung ry khyh oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kya-e kawpyapaw kha na dou oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:23">Deu 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Heb 3.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />nae bu kyakhe na ccohkuh oh zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hynh oun hua keiccuze Amor hae kuih kya pyate ro khylan Izip ram kyate oun poukhae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Teilangmou ah cceih cih oh? Aening puizia hae nynh, ‘Tuh-e ccungccaw hae tuh aening laeze mih thawsaehua zah a hanghua hae; khuapi hae tuh le hae zah khua athungkhawkuhpaw tuh vaawlui phe adia! Tuin kya Anak ciihan hae kha kae muih ccaccing hae!’ cikuhpaw thongpang khate aening thinlung kha oun tuisah hae,” na ci oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kae nynh nanning kyakhe, “Minmin kha siikuh nan oh lah, rih nan oh. <verse number="30-31" style="v" />Nae malang a cceihpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh Izip ram kya na muihnaw oh ccaccei khe ae cyipya oh hawte, e hmin kya na thua mawlaezung oh, na ccianaw oh laanpi balyn kya, lukhakheit nynh imua kha a pua hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh pawtemou ae pua oh cipaw na muihnaw oh, ramkaw kya nae hanlan rhaw ae tukpah cih oh paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:18">Loc 13.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="32-33" style="v" />Thuasalama ryahmin na tahkunaw lan oh paw hmin kha ccung khylan, na zui lan oh paw laanpi kha langsahpya khylan, khuazi ze maee te thuasah, khuadae ze maeking te thuasah nae malang ae cciapah oh paw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hynhte ae cyipah oh zahmah amaw kha na zyn khyh oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:19">Heb 3.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh A Dou keiccu Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Nam 14.20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae bya kha he a thae tuh, a thinria zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.34-35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:18">Heb 3.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />“Nae minpaaw hae kha pya lan cite bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram hoypaw kha hynh-e ahoy leipaw minphuin kya-e lu kheit nynh sanmah muih lan khyh, <verse number="36" style="v" />Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb rou nynh khah-e ram kha a muih cih, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw tynkaring lan a lungzi keiccuze a ccu te a synaw ram kha amaw te a ciihan hae kalan ka pya cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="37" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nanning keiccuze ka tungvaw heize a thinria zah, “Nang mah tuh-e ram lungkhu lang na tee lan khyh. <verse number="38" style="v" />Nang ae bawmtupaw Nun ccapaw Joshua tuh ram lungkhu lang a tee cih; aning tuh Israel kha ram a ccousahtupaw athua keiccuze thawzung pyatua. <verse number="39" style="v" />Rhaw nynh a kyng hae paw lang a tang cih hae cite na tua oh paw nae imua hae, atunin athya ahoy a nyh loh lei hae paw nae ccaaw hae tuh ram lungkhu lang a tee cih hae; ram tuh minmin ka pya cih hae zah minmin nynh ram kha a ccou cih hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh Rili Se lang cceihpaw laanpi thyhte ramkaw lang kitua oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nanning nynh kae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw kae sei vae! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh kaw oun pya thyhte kae cceihthung cih zah kae tuk cih,” nae cipya oh. Nanning balyn nynh nae rhaw zunghe kha kyngte mua alungnaw ram lungkhu lang cciathung lanpaw kha azoi lante na tua oh. <verse number="42" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Minmin kyakhe, ‘Cceihthung nan oh lah, tuk nan oh, pawccecize nanning laku ka um khyh; tuhkhyhze tuh nae rhaw hae nynh ae tae cih oh,’ cite hopah hae,” yn cipya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Kae hopya oh zemah na ngae khyh oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawpyapaw kha na dou oh zah mua alungnaw ram lungkhu lang lungkhungte na cciathung oh. <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuh-e mua alungnaw um hae paw Amor hae nynh ae pounua cih oh zah khoi nynh dee hawte ae dee cih oh zah Seir kyate Hormah kyacia ae tude cih oh. <verse number="45" style="v" />Nae ki oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang he na rah oh tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae roi kha ngaepya leite pawlang ae riapah vae lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ramkaw kya Kum hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kadesh kya na la um oh hawte khaw cia bua na um oh.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn hopya hawte aening nynh Rili Se lang khate ramkaw lang ah kithui oh zah, Seir Mua kha khaw cia ah voilu oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Nam 21.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mua alungnaw hynh-e ram hynh khaw cia na voilu vae cih. Palung lang hawite cceih oh lah, <verse number="4" style="v" />akawlan thyhte ccungccaw hae kha hopah oh: Seir kya umpaw nae puizia Esau ciihan hae ram kya na cceih vae cih oh. Minmin nynh nanning kha ae rih cih oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Gen 36.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />tukeiccuze minmin ryte rhaw na tukku khyh nawlan oh, hoyte raeringkuh oh, pawccecize mih ram kha ccuphe lyh sanmah nanning kae pya khyh oh, Seir Mua kha Esau uccaw lang phe ka pya vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ae lan oh paw looh kha minmin kyate phua te na rekuh cih oh; na nia lan oh paw tui kha mah phua te minmin kya-e na rekuh cih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na cyi oh paw miakaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hythua ae pya ccaccing vae oh; e ramkaw pi kya na ccia oh paw kha phe a ny. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kum sung pali lungkhu ae umkhae oh zah nae hanlan pawpaw mah ahoboupaw um khyh,” yn cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening nynh Seir kya umpaw ah puizia Esau ciihan hae pe khe ah cceih oh zah, Arabah laanpi kha cciatawte, Elath te Eziongeber kha mah cciatawte ah cceih oh. Moab ramkaw lang po a cceihpaw laanpi lang he ah cceih oh te, <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: “Moab kha vawsaw pya nan oh lah rhawtuk nan oh, pawccecize khah-e ram kha lytaraw sanmah nae ram lang kae pya lan khyh oh, pawccecize Ar ram kha Lot ciihan hae ram lang phe ka pya vae hae,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:37">Gen 19.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />(langmaw lyaze tuin ram kya Anak hae hawte hang hae zah ale hae paw te alung hae paw Emin hae nynh a la um hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab hae nynh minmin kha Emin cite a ko hae zemah Anak hae hawte minmin kha Refa hae lang nynh a ria hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, langmaw lyaze Hor hae nynh Seir ram kya a la um hae, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae a pya hae paw ram kya Israel hae nynh a cyi hae hawte Esau ciihan hae nynh Hor hae kha luadete theih hae zah Hor hae a umnaw hae kyakhe khua a sah hae.) <verse number="13" style="v" />“Oute atu, Zered Vaw kha zua khylan thokuh oh,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Tukeiccuze Zered Vaw kha ah zua oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea kyate ah thokuh oh zah Zered Vaw phe ah zua oh cia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rhawkaw hae konglang thyalawnaw bya kha a ho vae thyhte, tuh-e she e rhawkaw hae tuh ryahmin kyate marya a chih hae cia, sung thum kum tarya aro.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:28-35">Nam 14.28-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryahmin kyate minmin kha maemih khylan pong a chi mawlaezung hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih ccaccei nynh minmin kha a rawse ccaccing hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae laku kyate rhawkaw hae balyn he a chih kou takaw hae te, <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />“Atunin nanning nynh Moab ramri, Ar kyakhe po na cceih cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ammon hae ramri lang he na naekuh oh te, minmin kha vawsaw na pya lan khyh oh zah na tuk lan khyh oh, Ammon hae ram kha Lot ciihan hae kalan phe ka pya vae keiccu hae ze, nanning kha rho lang kae pya vae lan khyh oh,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:38">Gen 19.38</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />(Tuh-e ram mah Rafaim hae ram cite ci athuabua. Ammon hae nynh minmin kha Zamzummim hae cite a ko hae zemah langmaw lyaze tuin ram kya Refa hae nynh la um hae, <verse number="21" style="v" />Zamzum hae tuh Anak hae hawte hang hae zah athawsaepaw te alung hae paw nynh thua hae. Thuasalama Ammon hae nynh minmin kha dee khylan te mih umnaw kya um khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Ammon hae malang khe a ro hae. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Seir kya umpaw Esau ciihan hae hanlan tuhmaminte a cyipya hae—Esau ciihan hae nynh Hor hae kha luadete ro lan zah mih umnaw hmin kya atunin cia um khylan mih malang khe minmin kha a ro hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Gaza pepan khua taraw hae kya a um hae paw Avvim hae kha Kaftor kyate oun thua hae paw Kaftor hae nynh theih hae zah mih umnaw hmin kyakhe a um hae.) <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thokute cceih oh lah Arnon Vaw kha zua oh. Dotua oh, Amor minphuinpaw Heshbon siapharan Sihon te a ram kha nae kuih kya kae pya vae oh. Amaw kha tuk oh lah, ram kha law khylan tho ccavae oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaawlui zakaw umpaw ccungccaw hae kyakhe nanning ae ri nawlan oh paw te ae siiku nawlan oh paw kha atunin ka tho vae cih; nae thongpang kha he a thae hae te, nanning keiccuze a thyngkuh cih hae zah lungriathaete a um cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Sihon kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Nam 21.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Kedemoth ramkaw kyate Heshbon siapharan Sihon kalan zeccuetu hae kha akawlan e daenaw bya thyhte ka saw hae: <verse number="27" style="v" />“Na ram kya po ccianaw kaw nae ua zetuh, laanpi kya rou ka cceih cih zah voilang ranglang ka maekuh lan khyh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka ae lanpaw looh kha phua te nae zuapah cih zah ka nia lanpaw tui kha mah phua te nae zuapah cih. <verse number="29" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh oun pyapaw ram lungkhu langkhe tee khylan Jordan vaw ka zua mawlaezung, Seir kya um hae paw Esau ciihan hae te Ar kya um hae paw Moab hae nynh ka hanlan yn cyipya hae hawte, ccu te po ccianaw kaw kyalya oun ua,” ka cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuasalama Heshbon siapharan Sihon nynh aening po ccia lanpaw kha oun ua ry khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh atu a cyi vae hawte, Sihon kha nanning kuih kya pya khylan a lung kha tangsah zah a thinlung kha a khungsah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Dotua, Sihon te a ram tuh namaw kalan pya lan ka tho takaw vae. A ram lawku lanpaw kha atu tho ccavae oh,” yn cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Sihon te a ccungccaw hae balyn nynh aening kha rhawtuk khylan Jahaz kya he oun pounua hae tuh, <verse number="33" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh Sihon kha aening kalan oun pya; aening nynh amaw a ciihan hae te a ccungccaw hae balyn kha ah chia oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze a khua balyn kha ah lah oh zah khua takyh kya umpaw pise hae, nopi hae te imua hae kha marya ah maemih oh. Lu kheit sanmah a hiin te ah cciataw khyh oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Ah luade oh paw sahiin-awvaw te ah law oh paw khua kya-e uccaw hae rou kha nynh ahmaw hanlan ah lawku oh. <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon accya kin umpaw Aroer khua te accya kya umpaw khua kyate tho zah Gilead kyacia aening hanlan myarya ahangpaw khua khuakheit sanmah um khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh atyn-are kha oun pya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh a hopaw Ammor hae ram, Jabbok vaw kin palung lang balyn te mua alungnaw e khua hae kha naeku leite ah sibia oh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Og kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Nam 21.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aening nynh Bashan laanpi lang he ah cceihthung oh tuh, Bashan siapharan Og te a ccungccaw hae balyn nynh aening kha Edrei kya rhawtuk khylan oun pounua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kyakhe, “Amaw kha rih nan, pawccecize amaw ryte a ccungccaw hae te a ram hae kha na kuih kya kae pya vae. Heshbon a uktupaw Amor Siapharan Sihon tungvaw na cyi hawkhate a tungvaw kya cyitua,” yn cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh Bashan siapharan Og te a ccungccaw hae balyn kha mah ah kuih kya oun pya. Ahiinpaw lu kheit sanmah a um lei lan ciate ah tae oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze a khua balyn kha ah law oh; aening nynh minmin kyate khua sung taruh, Argob pee marya te Bashan kya umpaw Og peenaw kha ah lah oh zah ah law lei oh paw khua khuakheit sanmah um khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />E khua hae balyn tuh myarya lepaw khua hae patae apiaze, ahangpaw lungrua, koikua thyh ning, thingccaw hae te koihlupaw khua hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Heshbon siapharan Sihon tungvaw ah cyi oh hawte, minmin kha marya ah roh oh zah, khua raveih kya umpaw nopi hae, pise hae te imua hae kha khaleih ah chia oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama sahiin-awvaw balyn te khua hae kya-e ah luade oh paw uccaw hae kha tuh ahmaw hanlan ah nungku oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e ccyh lyaze Amor hae siapharan lu ning kyate Jordan vaw nithua lang e ram, Arnon vaw kin kyate Hermon mua kyacia, <verse number="9" style="v" />(Sidon hae nynh Hermon kha Sirion cite ko hae zah, Amor hae nynh tuh Senir cite a ko hae), <verse number="10" style="v" />mua sangpyng hae kya umpaw khua hae balyn, Gilead ram khaleih, Bahsan ram abalyn, Salekah te Edrei kyacia Bashan kya umpaw Og a peenaw e khua hae kha ah law oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />(Atu tuh Refa hae kya-e Bashan siapharan Og rou nynh a laehy vae. A ikhung, sivaw ikhung kha Amor hae khua Rabbah kya muih kho athua ung. Ccungccaw dong te dong takua sae zah dong pali ako.) <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram kha ah la law lya oh ze, Arnon Vaw kin umpaw Aroer palung lang, mua alungnaw Gilead ram angankuh te tuin kya-e khua hae kha Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae kalan ka pya hae, <verse number="13" style="v" />te Gilead ram alaepaw te Og peenaw Bashan abalyn kha Manasseh phin angankuh kalan ka pya hae. (Argob pee abalyn: Refa hae ram cite leih a ko hae paw Bashan abalyn kha nynh thua; <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh phin athuapaw Jair nynh Argob pee abalyn, Geshur hae te Maakath hae ramri kyacia a lawku, Bashan acikuh hae paw khua hae tuh amaw min kha phu zah, amaw koute atunin cia Havvoth-jair a ci hae.) <verse number="15" style="v" />Makhir tuh Gilead khua kha ka pya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae tuh Gilead kyate Arnon vaw kin cia, tuh-e vaw kin angaelung tuh ramri lante, Ammon hae ramri athuapaw Jabbok vaw kin cia ka pya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Arabah kha mah Jordan vaw te a vahue hae ryte, Khinnereth kyate Arabah rili, Rili Chihpaw kyacia, nithua lang umpaw Pisgah mua a nebungnaw balyn rykhate ka pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze nanning kha akawlan thyhte kae hopya oh: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh e ram hynh nanning ccou khylan ae pya vae oh salamah nae rhawkaw hae balyn tuh nae puizia Israel rhawkaw hae hawte zunghe ccyngkute khuraw lang a zua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Jos 1.12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae zu hae, nae ccaaw hae te nae sahiin-awvaw hae kha tuh kae pya oh paw khua hae kya a umsya cih hae (sahiin-awvaw patae na hoi oh cipaw ka ny). <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae puizia hae kha nanning hawte haeungnaw pya hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh minmin a pya cih hae paw Jordan vaw nithua lang he a ccou hae te, nanning lu kheit cci tuh kae pya vae oh paw ram lang na ki cih oh,” kae cipya oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te tuh ccyh lyaze Joshua kha mah ka hopah zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh hynh-e siapharan lu ning tungvaw a cyipaw atyn-are kha na mit ccaccei te phe na muih vae; tukeiccuze alungkhu kya po na cceih vae cih paw ram balyn kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn cyih cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin kha rih nan hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh na hanlan rhaw ae tukpah paw nynh thua,” ka cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moses nynh Kanaan Ram A Do</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thawte ka ngiakuh zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.23-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Nam 27.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">Deu 32.48-52</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, na lesaenaw te na thungnaw kha na seepaw kya langsahpya lanpaw kha tho kyalya nynh na tho ung; vaawlui kya te laephi vawlan umpaw pawcihawpaw pachia nynh mou nang na raepaw hawte cyisahnaw te thungnaw kha a rae kho? <verse number="25" style="v" />Jordan vaw khuraw lang e ram hoypaw mua alungnaw ram, ahoypaw te Lebanon kha muih khylan khuraw lang beih yn zuasah,” ka cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning konglang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka tungvaw a thinria zah ka bya kha yn ngaepah khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Zawsah! Hynh-e konglang hynh kharouhmaw bua yn hopah nan vae! <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah mua dung langkhe kaethung lah nithua, niccaw, palung lang, alia lang na pepan kha dotua. Hoyte do, pawccecize hynh-e Jordan vaw hynh na zua vae lan khyh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama Joshua kha hopya tua, amaw kha lungtangsah lah thawzung pyatua, pawccecize aning tuh hynh-e ccungccaw hae hynh lupi lante po a cciakhae cih hae zah, na muih cih paw ram te ram kya-e khyndadyh lante a ccousah cih hae paw nynh thua,” yn cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Beth-peor te arawsekunaw accya kyakhe ah um oh.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moses kyate Kawpyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Israel, tukeiccuze atu, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang teete ccou khylan na hiin ccaw oh, zui lan kae ccangpah cih oh paw phungbya hae te phungzae hae hynh ngaetua oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae pya oh paw bya kya ccangkheit sanmah na biachih lan khyh oh zah, ccangkheit sanmah na vua lan khyh oh, kae hopya oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae hynh na tynsah cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Bya 22.18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Baalpeor te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawtemou a cyi cipaw, Baalpeor a zuipaw miakaw kha nanning laku kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh pawtemou a ro hae cipaw kha naemaw ccaccei nynh phe na muih vae oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Nam 25.1-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha tynkaring lan na kyngkuh oh paw balyn tuh atunin na hiin oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dotua oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia nynh yn hopya thyhte, ccou khylan na tee vae cih oh paw ram kya na zui lan oh paw phungzae hae te phungbya hae kha atu kae ccangpya oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hynh-e hae hynh zuakute na zui cih oh, pawccecize hynh-e hynh nynh nae hawnaw te nae nynaw kha ccungccaw hae kya a langsakuh cih zah, minmin nynh hynh-e phungbya balyn hynh he a thae hae te, “E minphuin lepaw hynh a hawpaw te a nyhpaw minphuin ccaccing nynh thua!” cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh aening ah ko takyh oh te, oun naenuaku hawte, pawcihawpaw ccangpaw minphuin lepaw mou tuhte a naenuakuh hae paw pachia a hoi? <verse number="8" style="v" />Atunin nae malang kae nungpya oh paw hynh-e upadi balyn hawte pawcihawpaw ccangpaw minphuin lepaw mou phungbya hae te phungzae hae kha a hoi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nae she balyn kya nae mit nynh a muihpaw uccaw hae kha na ning khyh nawlan oh te nae tuanaw kyate azo khyh nawlan, naemaw te naemaw raeringkute ccykekuh oh; tuh-e hae tuh nae ccaaw hae te nae mintaw hae kha nysah oh— <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Laephi vawlan ccungccaw hae nynh a hiin lungkhu hae balyn, kae kha yn rithya nawlan hae te mih ccaaw hae kha mah a ccangpya thya nawlan hae, minmin kha kamaw hanlan pum hae lah, ka bya kha ka thaesah cih hae,” cite he yn hopah tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang Horeb kya nanning nynh na thadyn oh; <verse number="11" style="v" />nanning nynh mua leihpaw langkhe na naekuh oh zah, mua tuh vaawlui cia maeesoi te ruathung zah marae zipaw maeking nynh phang a bong.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-18">Exo 19.16-18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Heb 12.18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh maee kyate bya ae hopya oh. Bya accaepaw kha na thae oh salamah a muinsan kha na muih khyh oh; roi kyalya nynh accae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Zui lan ae pya oh paw a byakinnaw kha ae thaesah oh, tuh-e tuh kawbya ccanghaw kha nynh thua; te aning nynh tuh-e tuh lungphe phe ning vawlan khe a zei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Exo 31.18</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34.28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:10">Deu 9.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Te tuh-e ccyh lyaze nanning nynh ccou khylan na tee vae cih oh paw ram kya na zui lan oh paw phungzae hae te phungbya hae kha nanning ccangpya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha kaw yn pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:1">Exo 21.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha Horeb kya maee lungkhu te ae hopya lya oh ze, a muinsan kha na muih khyh keiccu oh ze, naemaw te naemaw hoyte raeringkute ccykekuh oh, <verse number="16" style="v" />tuhteze nynh hankhakheit muinsan alo lante naemaw hanlan akawlan e zohtuh kha raekute ahoy leipaw ozia kha na zui lan khyh oh, tuh-e hae tuh: ccungccapaw khyhze ccungccanung muinsan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Exo 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26.1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Deu 5.8</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />laephi vawlan umpaw sarangpaw phuinkhakheit muinsan, khivae kya azouthyapaw pavaw phuinkhakheit muinsan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17-18a: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom 1.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />lae vawlan avawpaw phuinkhakheit muinsan te lae kaw e tui kya umpaw ngasaw phuinkhakheit muinsan nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te vaawlui lang na dothung oh zah, khuanin, sawpaw te awsi, vaawlui umpaw uccaw balyn kha he na muih oh te, vaawlui zakaw pawpaw kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a ua hae paw khah-e uccaw hae kha bakhungnuate beiksei nan oh lah, zuisei nan oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh atunin na um oh hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccou hae paw a ccungccaw hae ccaccei lang tang khylan nanning kha Izip ram, sivaw tuisah khopaw maeephu kyate ae lah oh zah ae poukhae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Exo 19.5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Deu 7.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26.18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Pe 2.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka tungvaw a thinria zah, Jordan vaw ka zua khyh nawlan te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae rho lang ae pya cih oh paw ram hoypaw lungkhu lang ka tee khyh nawlan bya a kinku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Nam 20.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Kae tuh Jordan vaw zua leite e ram kya ka chih cih, thuasalama nanning tuh ram hoypaw kha ccou khylan khuraw lang na zua cih oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kya a raepaw byakinnaw kha na ning khyh nawlan oh te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae khee oh paw hankhakheit muinsan alo lante zohtuh na raeku khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh aruapaw maee, a eiungpaw Pachia nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Heb 12.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kya ccaaw hae te mintaw hae kha na hoi oh zah nae rynaw he accing te, hankhakheit muinsan lante zohtuh raekute hoyleinaw kha na rae oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia mitmuihnaw kya hoyleinaw raete a thin na riasah oh zetuh, <verse number="26" style="v" />ccou khylan Jordan vaw na zuanua cih oh paw ram kyate aro mawze khaleih na mih cih oh cite atunin nanning rawsete vaaw te lae kha ccaekia lang ka ko hae; tuh-e ram kya nae she sae lan khyh, marya na chih cih oh. <verse number="27" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ccungccaw hae laku ae phiasakuh cih oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae cciakhae cihnaw oh minphuin hae laku kya nanning beihtaraw kyalya na lae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:36">Deu 28.36</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin ram kya a muih kho leipaw, nawthae kho leipaw, a ae kho leipaw te amyn a thae kho leipaw, thing te lung hae kyate kuih te raepaw ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik cih oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na ccung cih oh zah, nae thinlung balynte, nae tuanaw balynte na ccung oh ze, amaw kha na muih cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:13">Jer 29.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Nae vawsawnaw kya yn thua cih paw ccyh kya tuh-e vawsawnaw hae balyn nae tungvaw he yn cyihkuh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan na kithui cih oh zah, a bya kha na ngae cih oh. <verse number="31" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh ngaethyaumsah thyapaw Pachia athua keiccuze nanning kha ae vua lan khyh oh zah ae roh lan khyh oh; nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw byakinnaw kha ning lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh laephi vawlan ccungccaw a rae takaw nin te nanning maw e kum hynhsepi e akonglang balyn kha atu khiatua oh; vaawlui voikheit lang te voikheit lang cia khiatua oh: hynhcih alepaw hankhakheit acyihkuh boi tou, tuhkhyhze hynh tahawpaw kha thae boi athua tou? <verse number="33" style="v" />Nanning nynh maee lungkhu te a hopaw pachia roi kha na thae oh hawte thae boi zah ahiinpaw hum ccungccaw mou a um? <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh Izip ram kyaze nae mit ccaccei malang khe nae hanlan ae cyipya oh hawte syntawtuanaw, muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw, rhawdounaw, athungpaw kuih te kuih dyngnaw, ri lan umpaw huhan langsahnaw liate minphuin phuin kheit kha amaw hanlan ccangpaw minphuin laku kyate law khylan ccianua lan a zuakuh boi paw pachia ccangkhakheit a um boi tou? <verse number="35" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia nynh thua cipaw na ny nawlan oh, hynh-e hynh nanning kalan langsahpyaku athua; amaw laelan ccangpaw um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mar 12.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Nanning ccangpya khylan vaawlang te a roi kha ae thaesah oh: laephi vawlan alesaepaw a maee kha ae langsahpakuh oh zah, maee kyate yn poupaw a bya kha na thae oh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Te nae minpaaw hae kha a sungsah keiccu hae ze, mimaw nukhute mih ciihan hae kha a po hae. Nanning kha Izip ram kyate amaw malang ccaccei khe alesaepaw huhan khate ae poukhae oh, <verse number="38" style="v" />Nanning laeze ale huapaw te athawsae huapaw minphuin hae ram kha nanning kalan rho lang pyate a lungkhu lang teekhae khylan, atunin cia acyiku hawte minmin kha nae malang te a dee hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ahangnaw vaawram te anenaw laephi kyaze Pachia nynh thua cipaw kha atunin nyh oh lah, nae thinlung kya ccykeku tua oh; ccangpaw um khyh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Naemaw te nae nukhu e nae ciihan hae ngedang lungpawnaw hanlan atunin kaw kae pya cih oh paw a phungbya hae te a kawbya hae kha tynsah oh, tuhteze nynh nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh zungzae hanlan ae pya cih oh paw ram kya nae hiinshe asae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khynnaw Khuapi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Oute Moses nynh khuapi khua thum kha Jordan vaw nithua langkhe ccangte a phia hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.41-43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:8-9">Jos 20.8-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v" />langmaw ze rhawkunaw a umty leite ccangpaw ccungccaw kha paccynnuaku leite a theihseipaw lukhakheit tuh tuh-e khuapi hae kalan khe a ccue kho; ccungccaw theihpaw nynh tuh-e khua khuakhakheit kalan khe a ccue cih zah a hiin cih; <verse number="43" style="v" />tuh-e khuapi hae tuh Reuben phin hae kya-e ramkaw accya umpaw Bezer, Gad phin hae kya-e Gilead kya umpaw Ramoth, te Manasseh phin hae kya-e Bashan kya umpaw Golan nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Vaeningnaw Byahonaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />E tuh Moses nynh Israel hae kya a nungpya hae paw upadi nynh thua. <verse number="45" style="v" />E hae tuh Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate he a pou hae te, Moses nynh Israel hae a hopya hae paw phunglang hae, phungbya hae te phungzae hae nynh thua. <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses te Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate he a pou hae te, a tae hae paw Heshbon a uktupaw Amor hae siapharan Sihon ram kya, Jordan vaw nithua lang, Beth-peor te arawsekunaw accya kyakhe a hopya hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Minmin nynh Sihon ram te Bashan Siapharan Og ram kha a law hae, tuh-e hae tuh Jordan vaw nithua lang umpaw Amor hae siapharan hae lu ning nynh thua hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Arnon Vahue akin lang umpaw Aroer kyate Sirion Mua kyacia, (tuh-e tuh Hermon nynh thua), <verse number="49" style="v" />tuh-e hae ryte Jordan vaw nithua lang umpaw Arabah abalyn kyate Pisgah mua hary apannaw zakaw umpaw Arabah Rili kyacia a law hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawbya Ccanghaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Exo 20.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses nynh Israel hae balyn kha ko hae zah hynhte a hopya hae: Pou Israel, atunin kae hopya oh paw phungbya hae te phungzae hae kha ngaetua oh; khah-e hae kha na ccangkuh cih oh zah hoyte na zui cih oh. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh Horeb kya aening ryte byakinnaw a rae. <verse number="3" style="v" />E byakinnaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening minpaaw hae ryte rae khyh, thuasalama atunin hein kya ah hiin oh paw aening balyn ryte nynh a rae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mua kyakhe mae hawiliakute maee lungkhu te bya ae hopya oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />(Tuh ccyh lyaze kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha nanning kalan thaesah khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te nanning laku khe ka thadyn; pawccecize nanning tuh maee keiccuze na rih oh zah, mua lang na kaethung khyh oh.) Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae tuh Izip ram seetangnaw kyate ae poukhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua; <verse number="7" style="v" />kamaw laelan ccangpaw pachia hae kha na hoi lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naemaw hanlan ahangnaw vaawram kya thuasah, anenaw laephi kya thuasah, lae kaw umpaw tui kya thuasah, hankhakheit muinsan alo lante zohtuh kha na raekuh lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26.1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Deu 4.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Khah-e zohtuh hae kha bakhungnuate na beik lan khyh oh; pawccecize kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia, a eiungpaw Pachia nynh ka thua, kamaw yn vua hae paw kha she thum, she pali cia, nungpaaw hae seinaw hanlan ccaaw hae tungvaw kya de a tah hae paw nynh ka thua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Exo 34.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Nam 14.18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">Deu 7.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />thuasalama kae kha yn sungsah zah, ka kawbya kha a zui hae paw kyakhe mih she thong kheit cia atynpaw sungsahnaw kha a langsahpakuh hae paw nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia min kha ahme lei lante na mang lan khyh, pawccecize amaw min kha ahme lei lante a mangpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngaethya lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh kaw ae pya thyhte, sabbath nin kha naawsah lah, thyaasah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23-30">Exo 16.23-30</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 31:12-14">31.12-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Nin taruh lungkhu rya na lah cih zah, na ryalaw balyn kha na lawkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Exo 23.12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31.15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34.21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35.2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lev 23.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama nin sarinaw nin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia hanlan sabbath nynh thua, tuh-e nin kya namaw, na ccapaw, na ccanung, na seenung, na seepaw, na vaetua, na lann, na sahiin-awvaw miakaw te na khua kya umpaw mikhia nynh pawpaw rya mah na lah lan khyh oh, tuhteze nynh na seenung te na seepaw hae tuh namaw hawte a haeungbua cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram kya see lang na la tangpaw, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh Izip ram kyate athungpaw kuih te a dyngpaw kuih khate ae poukhaepaw kha ning nan; tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh sabbath naawsah lanpaw kha kaw ae pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh kaw ae pya thyhte na nung te na paaw kha sawtua, tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae pya cih paw ram kya na hiinshe asae cih zah, ngedang lungpawte na um cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:16">Deu 27.16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat 15.4</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19.19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7.10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2">Efe 6.2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:3">3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw na theih lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Gen 9.6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lev 24.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5.21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13.9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Jam 2.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milae zu kya khyhze milae vawpaw kya na sei lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mat 5.27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13.9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Jam 2.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ruh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:11">Lev 19.11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na innpaw kha rawsete ahme leipaw ccaekia lang na tang lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Exo 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na innpaw zu kha na duaa lan khyh. Na innpaw kya-e inn, loo, seenung, seepaw, vaetua, lann, na innpaw kya-e hankhakheit kha na duaa lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7">Rom 7.7</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Rynaw Hopiatu Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e bya hae hynh mua kya na pumkuh oh paw balyn kalan maee, maeking te marae zipaw mohnaw kyate roi accae lante ae hopah oh zah, ccangpaw ae hopah chih vae khyh oh. E bya hae hynh lungphe phe ning vawlan zei zah, kae kha yn pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.22-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Heb 12.18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Mua tuh maee lang arua cciamang lyakhe nanning nynh mohnaw kya-e roi kha he na thae oh te, nae phin kya-e lupi hae balyn te nae piccan hae tuh ka kalan oun naekuh hae; <verse number="24" style="v" />nanning nynh, “Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh a phu-enaw te a lesaenaw kha oun langsahpakuh vae zah, maee kyate a roi kha kae thae vae. Pachia te ccungccaw tuh bya a hoku hae zemah, ccungccaw tuh phang ahiin ung cipaw atunin kae muih vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening tuh atu pawcce ah chih cih oh? Pawccecize hynh-e myarya lepaw maee nynh aening kha pong oun u cih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia roi kha hynhlaeze accyh aro lante bua ah thae oh zetuh ah chih cih oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Maee lungkhu te bya yn hopaw ahiinpaw Pachia roi kha aening hawte thae zah a hiin ungpaw hum ccungccaw mou a um? <verse number="27" style="v" />Namaw ccaccei nynh naekuh lah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh a ho cih paw bya balyn kha la ngaetua. Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh ae hopyapaw atyn-are kha oun hopah lah, kaening nynh kae ngae cih zah kae cyih cih,” na ci oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nae hopya oh paw bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh he a thae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “E ccungccaw hae nynh ae hopya hae paw bya kha phe ka thae vae. Minmin nynh a ho hae paw bya balyn tuh ahme. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin nynh kae kha ri khylan te ka kawbya balyn kha zungzae zui khylan, atu hawte hynhcihawpaw thinlung kha a hoi hae ze rou nynh minmin te mih ccaaw hae tuh ngedang lungpawte zungzae a um cih hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />La cceih lah minmin kha, ‘Nae bu kalan ki ccavae oh,’ cite hopah hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh ka pe hin thadyn lah minmin kalan na ccangpya lan hae paw kawbya balyn, phungbya hae te phungzae hae kha kae hopah cih, tuhteze nynh rho lang ka pya cih hae paw ram kyakhe minmin nynh khah-e hae kha a zui cih hae,” yn cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kaw ae pya oh hawte, hoyte na cyih cih oh, nanning nynh voilang ranglang na maekuh lan khyh oh. <verse number="33" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kaw ae pya oh paw laanpi kha asasite na zui cih oh, tuhteze nynh na ccou cih oh paw ram kya ngedang lungpawte na hiin cih oh zah, nae hiinshe asae cih.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawbya Lepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh nanning nynh ccou khylan na ccianua oh paw ram kya zui lan cite nanning ccangpya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh yn hopyapaw kawbya hae—phungbya hae te phungzae hae nynh thua, <verse number="2" style="v" />tuhteze nynh naemaw te nae ccaaw hae, te nae mintaw hae nynh nae hiinshe balyn kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na rih cih oh zah, kaw kae pya oh paw a phunglang hae te a kawbya hae kha na zui cih oh zah nae she asae cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou Israel, nae minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ae kinpyaku thyhte ngedang lungpawte na um nawlan te, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram kya pataepi na pungthung nawlan, kawbya hae hynh ngae lah zuakute zuitua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Israel, ngaetua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ah Pachia, ccangkheit kyalyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:29">Mar 12.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na thinlung balyn te, na tuanaw balyn te, na thawzung balyn te na sungsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:37">Mat 22.37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:30">Mar 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luk 10.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pyapaw hynh-e bya hae hynh na thinlung kya ccykekuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.6-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:18-20">Deu 11.18-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Hynh-e bya hae hynh na ccaaw hae kya hopah bua hae lah, innvaw na um ze thuasah, laansaw lang na um ze thuasah, na ih ze thuasah, na thoku ze thuasah hynh-e bya hae kong hynh hopah hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hynh-e bya hae hynh muihsahnaw lante na kuih kya khiikuh lah, na terui kyakhe syntawnaw lante khiidekuh, <verse number="9" style="v" />te na inn thuakaw tung hae kya te na koikua hae kyakhe zei hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawngae leinaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh na minpaaw hae Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram tuh—ram hoypaw, nang nynh na sak leipaw khuapi hae nynh thua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Gen 12.7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26.3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />na teekhae leipaw uccaw ahoypaw aphuinphuin te phe beihpaw inn hae, na thae leipaw tuisung hae, na lin leipaw misu khokhu hae te oliv ku hae kalan cciate—na ae zah he na byn te, <verse number="12" style="v" />Izip ram seetangnaw kyate ae poukhaepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na ning khyh nawlan raeringkuh. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na rih cih, amaw kha na beik cih zah, amaw min kyalya te bya na kinkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:8">Luk 4.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccangpaw pachia hae, na pepan umpaw ccungccaw hae kya-e pachia hankhakheit kha na zui lan khyh, <verse number="15" style="v" />pawccecize ae umkhaepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia tuh a eiungpaw Pachia nynh thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia thinrianaw nynh maee lang ae ruanua cih zah, laephipi kyate ae rohsei cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha Massah kya na syntawtua hawte, syntaw nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Exo 17.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mat 4.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luk 4.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh kaw ae pyapaw a kawbya hae, a phungbya hae te a phunglang hae kha zuakute na zui cih. <verse number="18-19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mitmuihnaw kyakhe ahmepaw te ahoypaw kha cyitua, tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ae kinpyaku thyhte na rhaw hae balyn kha na malang te na dee kho cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na minpaaw hae kyaze nanning kha pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram hoypaw kalan na tee cih, na ccou kho cih zah ngedang lungpawte na um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Malang ccyh kya na ccaaw hae nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh kaw ae pyapaw phunglang hae, phungbya hae te phungzae hae asuilan hynh pawmou athua?” cite he ae khia hae te, <verse number="21" style="v" />nang nynh na ccaaw hae kha, “Kaening tuh Izip ram kya Faro see lang kae la tang, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh athawsaepaw kuih te Izip ram kyate oun poukhae. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip ram, Faro te a innbyn hae balyn kha rawsete, ri lan umpaw muihsahnaw ale hae paw te ngaeangnaw hae kha kaening mitmuihnaw kya a langsahku. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ah minpaaw hae kyaze aening pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang teekhae khylan Izip ram kyate aening hynh oun poukhae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Atu acyiku hawte, aening hiinnaw thungkhaw khylan te aening zungzae hoynaw hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kha ri lanpaw te hynh-e phungzae hae balyn zui lanpaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening kha kaw oun pya. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh kaw oun pya thyhte amaw malang khe hynh-e kawbya balyn hynh zuakute ah zui oh zetuh, adingpaw kya ah um cih oh,” cite na hopah cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Popaw Ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Exo 34.11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang nynh ccou khylan na tee vae cih paw ram lungkhu langkhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae cciakhae zah, na malang e minphuin patae, Hit hae, Girgash hae, Amor hae, Kanaan hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebu hae, nanning laeze mih thawsaehua zah alunghua hae paw minphuin phuin sari kha dee hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:19">Loc 13.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh minmin kha namaw kalan ae pya zah, he na tae te, minmin kha marya na roh cih hae. Minmin ryte byakinnaw na rae lan khyh zah, minmin tungvaw thawccinaw na langsakuh lan khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin ryte zuvaw lang na tang lan khyh oh, na ccanung hae kha mih ccapaw hae kalan na pya lan khyh, na ccapaw hae hanlan mih ccanung hae kha zu lang na dypah lan khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize na ccaaw hae kha ccangpaw pachia hae beik khylan kamaw zuinaw kyate ccanglang a maesakuhsei cih hae. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw nynh maee lang ae ruanua cih zah, nang kha arangte ae roh cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin tungvaw hynhte na cyih cih: mih silawhang hae kha na phoupah cih hae, mih lungpum hae kha na ropah cih hae, mih Ashrim thing hae kha na baepah cih hae zah, a raeku hae paw mih khozi zohtuh hae kha maee te na upah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:3">Deu 12.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan athyaapaw minphuin nynh na thua oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha laephi vawlan e ccungccaw balyn kyate a ccungccaw hae lang, asung-epaw a rho lang ae poku vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Exo 19.5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Deu 4.20</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26.18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Pe 2.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning tuh ccangpaw minphuin laeze na lunghua keiccu oh ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae sungsah oh zah, ae poku oh paw thua khyh, nanning tuh mingccang hae laeze azya huaccepaw nynh na thua oh. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ae sungsah oh zah, nae minpaaw hae kya bya a la kinkupaw byakinnaw kha a tynsah keiccuze nanning kha Izip siapharan Faro kuih kyate thuasah, seetangnaw kyate thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thawsaepaw kuih te ae poukhae oh zah, ae shawkhaw oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh Pachia thua zah, amaw kha a sungsah hae paw te a kawbya a zui hae paw tungvaw kya she thong kheit cia, byakinnaw te lungzi sungsahkunaw kha a tynsahpaw Pachia nynh thua cipaw nytua oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Exo 20.5-6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Nam 14.18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Deu 5.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />te amaw kha a vua hae paw ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya a liarupaw Pachia nynh thua cipaw kha nytua oh. Amaw kha a vua hae paw kya thysung leite a liaru hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atunin kaw kae pya oh paw kawbya—phungbya hae te phungzae hae hynh zuakute zui oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawngaenaw te Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Deu 28.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />E phungzae hae hynh zuakute na zui oh zah na ngae oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw byakinnaw te lungzi sungsahkunaw kha nae kya a tynsah cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Deu 11.13-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae sungsah cih oh, hythua ae pya cih oh zah ae pungzaesah cih oh, nanning pya khylan nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram kya nae ccaaw hae te nae laephi kya-e thingthae-eccang hae, nae looh, nae misutui, nae chitui, nae sahiin pungthungnaw te nae tuuphu ataw hae kha hythua a pya cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning tuh minphuin hae kyaze hythua a mue huaccepaw na thua cih oh zah, nanning laku kya thuasah, nae sahiin-awvaw kya thuasah atinpaw um lan khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccinaw miakaw kha nanning kyate a vua cih, na la ny oh paw Izip ram kya-e ri lan umpaw ccinaw balyn kha nae tungvaw thua sah lan khyh, thuasalama nanning ae hua oh paw tungvaw kya tuh-e ccinaw tuh a thuasah cih. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ccungccaw balyn kha thawccinaw langsapyaku leite na roh cih oh; mih pachia hae kha na roh cih oh; mih pachia hae kha na beik lan khyh oh, pawccecize nae hanlan tuh-e tuh kaang athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hynh-e minphuin hae tuh kaening laeze alunghua hae; pawtemou kae luade kho cih hae?” cite nae thinlung kya na tuaku oh ze, <verse number="18" style="v" />minmin kha rih nan oh. Faro tungvaw te Izip hae balyn tungvaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh pawtemou a cyi cipaw kha thuasah, <verse number="19" style="v" />nae mit nynh a muihpaw alepaw syntawnaw hae kha thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae poukhaenaw oh paw muihsahnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae athawsaepaw kuih te a dyngpaw kuihbaw kha thuasah liathui oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh na ripya oh paw ccungccaw balyn tungvaw kyakhe tuhawte a cyih cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhpiaze a hiinhy hae paw te a rekuh hae paw kha heize a ro makhia hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh khoingae kha a sawnua cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin kha rih nan oh, pawccecize ae umkhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh alesaepaw te ri lan umpaw Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh khah-e minphuin hae kha nae malang te beihtararaw khate a dee cih hae; minmin kha arangte na thangsah kho lan khyh oh, tuhkhyhze tuh loramsaw hae tuh nae hanlan myaryamaw alungsei cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha nanning kalan ae pya cih oh zah, minmin a ro makhia hae, myaryamaw a siisakuh cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih siapharan hae kha nae kuih kya ae pya cih oh zah, minmin kha vaawlui zakaw kyate a maemih cih hae; minmin kha na ro makhia oh, lu kheit nynh sanmah rawsete ae thadynnua kho lan khyh oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />A soii hae paw mih pachia hae kha maee te na u cih oh, tuh-e pachia hae kya umpaw ngun te sui kha duaa nan oh lah, naemaw hanlan lawkuh nan oh, pawccecize tuh-e liate kaang na kae sei cih oh; pawccecize tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan anungsikuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw uccaw kha nae inn lungkhu lang teekhae nan oh, tuhkhyhze tuh tuh-e uccaw hawte ro khylan phia na thuasei cih oh. Tuh-e tuh myaryamaw na hua cih oh zah anungsikuhpaw lang na ria cih oh, pawccecize ro khylan phia athua.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hoirumnaw kya Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning nynh na hiin oh zah na pungthung nawlan oh te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang teete na ccou kho nawlan oh, atunin kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e kawbya balyn hynh zuakute na zui hahe cih oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />A kawbya kha na zui oh tou, na zui khyh oh tou cipaw te nae thinlung kya umpaw kha ny nawlan syntawtuate nanning zakawsangsahku thya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ramkaw kya kum sung pali lungkhu ae cciakhaenaw oh asawpaw laanpi kha liathui oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw hynh looh kyalya te hiinkuh khyh, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khalang kyate yn poupaw bya miakaw te nynh ahiinku cipaw thaethyasah khylan nae vuelawsahte zakaw ae sangsahku oh, nanning nynh thuasah, nae minpaaw hae nynh thuasah na la ny boi lei oh paw manna sanlou kha ae dang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:4">Mat 4.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:4">Luk 4.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynh-e kum sung pali lungkhu nae boeining pue khyh zah nae ccu mah phin khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nungpaaw nynh ccaaw kha a thuihei hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha ae thuihei oh cipaw kha nae thinlung te nyh oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze amaw laanpi kha zuite, amaw rawrite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya kha zui oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ahoypaw ram lungkhu lang vaw taraw hae, mua hae kya te accya hae kya a pouthungpaw lae kaw e tui te tuidy aluanaw ram, <verse number="8" style="v" />chanvuih, barli, misu ku hae, thaeku ku hae te ccalee ku hae alungnaw ram, oliv ku hae te khoitui alungnaw ram, <verse number="9" style="v" />sanlou akhin lei lante na ae cihnaw oh te pawpaw mah na khin cih leinaw oh ram, a lung hae tuh sivaw lang a tang cihnaw te mua hae kyate sohin na thae kho cihnaw oh ram lang ae cciakhae cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Phe byn lang na ae cih oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw ram hoypaw hanlan amaw kha the na hoysah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw a kawbya hae, a phungzae hae, a phungbya hae kha zui leite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na ning khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:5-6">Hos 13.5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Phe byn lang na ae oh zah ahoypaw inn hae kha na sak oh zah tuh-e inn hae kya he na um oh te thuasah, <verse number="13" style="v" />nae vaetua phu hae te nae tuuphu hae tuh pungthung hae zah nae sui te nae ngun tuh lungthung zah na hoi oh paw balyn tuh he a lungthung te thuasah, <verse number="14-15" style="v" />Izip ram seetangnaw kyate ae poukhae oh zah, myarya akopaw te ri lan umpaw ram, sy a hoipaw hupaw te zekang lung zah tui um leinaw ramrou kya ae cciakhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha ningte naemaw te naemaw thehoysakuh nan oh. Nanning hanlan rihlung kyate tui luasah zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />nanning kha zakawsangsahku khylan te syntawtuate athangnaw kya nae hanlan hoynaw raepya khylan nae minpaaw hae nynh a ny lei hae paw manna sanlou khate ramkaw kya ae dang oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Naemaw te naemaw kha, “Ka huhan te ka kuih thungnaw nynh hynh-e hoirumnaw hynh yn muesah,” cite tuakuh nan oh. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha ning nan oh; pawccecize aning tuh atunin a cyi hawte nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw a byakinnaw kha a tynsah nawlan hoirumnaw muenawpaw huhan ae pyatu oh paw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na ning oh zah ccangpaw pachia hae kha zuite na beik oh zah rya na lawpya oh zetuh na roh ccaccing cih oh cipaw atunin raeringnaw hoyte kae pya oh. <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia roi kha na ngae khyh keiccu oh ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae malang a ro hae paw minphuin hae hawte na roh cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Dounaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Exo 32.1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Israel, ngaetua, nang laeze ale huapaw te athawsae huapaw minphuin hae kha thuasah, khuapi pi hae te vaawlui phe phah lan cia koihkhawkuhpaw khuapi hae kha thuasah, <verse number="2" style="v" />na ny hae paw Anak ciihan hae athawsaepaw te ahangpaw ccungccaw hae kha teenuate law khylan atunin Jordan vaw kha na zua vae cih. Minmin nynh, “Hum nynh mou Anak hae kha a thadynnua kho cih hae,” cite a ho hae paw kha na thae vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh aruapaw maee hawte atunin na malang po cceih cih paw nynh thua cipaw nytua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ae kinpyaku thyhte minmin kha arangte na dee hae zah na ro kho nawlan hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha na malang khe a shungsah cih hae zah a tae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh minmin kha na malang khe he a dee hae te, namaw te namaw kha, “E tuh ka dingnaw liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e ram ccou khylan yn cciakhae,” cite tuakuh nan; e tuh hynh-e minphuin hae hoyleinaw keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha na malang te a dee lan hae paw kha nynh athua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na dingnaw liate thuasah, na thinlung dingnaw liate thuasah mih ram kha ccou khylan na tee lanpaw thua khyh; thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na minpaaw Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya byakinpyakute a la raepaw byakinnaw kha ccingsah khylan hynh-e minphuin hae hoyleinaw keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh minmin kha na malang khe a dee lan hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oute na dingnaw keiccuze hynh-e ram hoypaw hynh ccou khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae pya lan khyh cipaw kha nytua; pawccecize nang tuh alungkhungpaw ccungccaw nynh na thua. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia a thinria nawlan ramkaw kya pawtemou na rae cipaw kha ning nan lah liathuitua; Izip ram atolang na pou nin kyate hynh-e hmin na thua cia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na dou vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb kya heize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thin na riasah keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na tungvaw myaryamaw a thinria zah, nang kha ro lan ciate a paccynkuh. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning ryte byakinnaw a raenawpaw lungphe hae kha law khylan mua lang he ka kaethung tuh, mua vawlan nin sung pali te zi sung pali ka um; looh mah ka ae khyh zah tui mah ka neih khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:18">Exo 24.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuihdung te zeipaw lungphe phe ning kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn pya; pumkunaw nin kya mua vawlan maee lungkhu te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae hopya oh paw bya balyn tuh tuh-e lungphe hae vawlan a um. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nin sung pali te zi sung pali athang te byakinnaw lungphe phe ning kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn pya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Thokuh lah, hynh-e kyate arangte cceihbung, pawccecize Izip ram kyate na poukhae hae paw na ccungccaw hae nynh ozia ahoy lei lante a cyi vae hae. Kaw ka pya hae paw laanpi kyate arangte a maekuh vae hae; minmin nynh mimaw hanlan zohtuh kha laeekute a raeku vae hae,” yn cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “E ccungccaw hae hynh mih lungkhungpaw nynh thua ccaccing hae cipaw ka muih vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin kha ka roh hae zah mih min kha vaawlui zakaw kyate ka the ccaw hae, ka makhaete yn umsah; nang kha minmin laeze athunghuapaw te alung huapaw lang kae rae cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mua vawlan maee rua lyakhe ka maeleihkuh zah mua kyate ka cceihbung; byakin lungphe phe ning tuh ka kuih voi ning kya a um hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute vaetuataw azuh muinsan kha nae hanlan raekute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw na sei ccaccing vae oh cipaw kha ka muih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw ae pya oh paw laanpi kyate maeku lan myarya nae thyrang. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lungphe phe ning kha ka lah zah, ka kuih voi ning te ka vua zah, nae muihnaw kya ka koi hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Oute langmaw hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang nin sung pali zi sung pali ka bakhung; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mitmuihnaw kya hoyleinaw na rae oh zah amaw kha thinriasahte seinaw na rae oh paw balyn keiccuze looh mah ka ae khyh zah tui mah ka neih khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning kha ro lan ciate a thinria keiccuze myarya lepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw kha ka rih. Thuasalama tuh-e ccyh kya mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka bya kha yn ngaepya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">Heb 12.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Aaron tungvaw myarya a thinria zah, Aaron kha ro lan a paccynku, thuasalama tuh ccyh lya mah Aaron hanlan saw ka sangpya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute na rae oh paw aseipaw uccaw athuapaw vaetuataw kha ka lah zah, maee te ka u zah ka tuisah, akhui lang phe tang lan cia ka miaa; tuh-e akhui kha mua kyate a luabungpaw vaw taraw kyakhe ka vua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Teberah, Massah kya te Kibroth-hattaavah kyakhe mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thin na riasah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:3">Nam 11.3</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 11:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Exo 17.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kadesh-barnea kyate ae saw oh zah, “Cceihthung oh lah, kae pya oh paw ram kha lawku tua oh,” cite he ae cipah oh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kaw ae pya oh paw kha na dou oh, amaw kha na zyn khyh oh zah na zui khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:25-14:38">Nam 13.25—14.38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Deu 1.21</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 1:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Heb 3.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning kha kae ny nin oh kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na dou vae oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ro lan he a tuakuh te, nin sung pali te zi sung pali lungkhu balyn <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang bakhungte, <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw ka sang zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, na lesaenaw te na shawkhaw hae paw, athungpaw na kuih te Izip ram atolang na poukhae hae paw, na ccou ccaccing hae paw ccungccaw hae kha roh nan hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Na see hae Abraham, Isak te Jakob kha ning nan hae; hynh-e ccungccaw hae lungkhungnaw, mih hoyleinaw te mih seinaw kha ccuinpah nan hae, <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze tuh kaening nae poukhaenaw ram nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang a cciakhae kho vae khyh keiccu hae ze thuasah, minmin kha a hua keiccu hae ze thuasah, ramkaw kya chisah khylan a poukhae hae,’ cite a hosei cih hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh alesaepaw na huhan te thuasah, na dyngpaw na kuih te thuasah na poukhae hae paw na ccou ccaccing hae paw ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae,” ka ci.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lungphe Phe Ningnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Exo 34.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Langmawlya e lungphe hae hawte lungphe phe ning kha aw lah mua vawlan kamaw kalan yn kaethungtua, te thingkua kha mah raetua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Na koipaw langmaw e lungphe hae vawlan umpaw bya hae kha nyalang e lungphe hae kya ka zei cih, te tuh-e lungphe hae tuh thingkua lungkhu na nung cih,” yn cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze eri thing te thingkua ka rae zah langmaw e lungphe hae te alokuhpaw lungphe phe ning kha ka rae, tuh-e lungphe phe ning kha ka kuih kya ccyngte mua lang ka kaethung. <verse number="4" style="v" />Oute na pumku lya oh ze, maee lungkhu te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mua vawlan ae hopya oh paw kawbya ccanghaw, langmawlya e te alokuhpaw bya hae kha lungphe hae vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh zei zah kae kha yn pya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te ka maeleihkuh zah mua kyate ka rungbung, te ka raepaw thingkua lungkhu khe lungphe hae kha ka nung; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw yn pya thyhte tuh-e lungphe hae tuh tuin kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Israel hae tuh Beeroth Bene-jaakan kyate Moserah lang a cceih hae. Tuin kyakhe Aaron tuh chih zah a uu hae; a ccapaw Eleazar tuh amaw ccelang ranpibawi lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:28">Nam 20.28</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 33:38">33.38</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel hae tuh tuin kyate Gudgodah, Gudgodah kyate vaw taraw hae a luanaw ram Jotbathah lang a cceih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua puih khylan thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalawpya khylan amaw malang thadyn lan thuasah, te amaw min te hythuapya khylan thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Levi phin kha laesah zah atunin cia tuhcite a cyi hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-8">Nam 3.5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Levi tuh neekupaw thuasah, rho thuasah a uno hae hawte hoi khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw kha bya a kinpyaku thyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a rho nynh thua.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Masaty lya hawte mua vawlan khe nin sung pali te zi sung pali ka um. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka bya kha vaekheit bua yn ngaepya. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ae roh ry khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:28">Exo 34.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Thokuh lah, mih minpaaw hae kya kae pya cih oh cite bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang tee hae zah a ccou ccaw hae, ccungccaw hae kha lupi lante cciakhae hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh A Rypaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou Israel, tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh atu pawmou ae peki? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia rawri lanpaw, a laanpi balyn kya ccia lanpaw, amaw sungsah lanpaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na thinlung balyn te, na tuanaw balyn te ryalawpya lanpaw, <verse number="13" style="v" />te namaw hoynaw te thanenaw hanlan atunin kaw kae pyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kawbya hae te a phungbya hae kha zui lanpaw kyalya kha nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaawlui te vaawram hae kyaze ahang huapaw vaawram thuasah, laephi te laephi kya umpaw balyn thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kya-e athua zemah, <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na minpaaw hae kyalya kha a thinlung te sungsah hae zah, minmin ciihan athuapaw nang kha, atunin acyiku hawte minphuin balyn laku te ae po vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute nae thinlung vingdung kha awkuh oh lah, nae lungkhung nan vae sah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh pachia hae Pachia te bawipaw hae Bawipaw, alesaepaw Pachia, athungpaw te ri lan umpaw, maedo a mang leipaw te pyaruh a lawkuh leipaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1Ti 6.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:14">Bya 17.14</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:16">19.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:34">Loc 10.34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6">Gal 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />ngawraw te nomae hanlan ahmete byapiapah hae paw te mikhia hae kha sungsah hae zah looh te boeining a bawmtupaw Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Mikhia hae kha na sungsah cih oh, pawccecize nanning tuh Izip ram kya mikhia nynh na la thua oh. <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na rih cih, amaw kyalya kha na beik cih; amaw kha tynkaring lan na kyngkuh cih zah amaw min te bya na kinkuh cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning tuh na thehoynawpaw nynh thua; na mit te na muih vae paw hynh-e alesaepaw te ri lan umpaw uccaw hae kha ae raepahpaw na Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Na minpaaw hae tuh ccungccaw sung sari te Izip ram lang a cceihbung hae; atu vae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh nang kha vaawlui e awsi zeih alung lante ae rae vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15.5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22.17</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawngaenaw hanlan Lasung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na sungsah cih zah a thuiheinaw bya, a phungbya, a phungzae te a kawbya hae kha zungzae na zui cih. <verse number="2" style="v" />(<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kya-e ccangpyanaw kha a muih lei hae paw te a nyh lei hae paw) nae ccaaw hae kha ka hopya hae paw thua khyh, thuasalama a lesaenaw, a thungnaw te a dyngpaw a kuih kha thuasah, <verse number="3" style="v" />Izip ram kyaze Izip siapharan Faro te a ram balyn kya a la cyipaw muihsahnaw hae te a ryalaw hae kha thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:13">Exo 7.8—12.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Izip rhawkaw hae tungvaw, mih marang hae te mih marangle hae kya a la cyipaw kha thuasah, minmin nynh ae deehui lya oh ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha atunin cia ro khylan Rili Se kya-e tui kha mih tungvaw a luasah thin hae paw kha thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:28">Exo 14.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />e hmin kya na thua makhia oh, aning nynh ramkaw kya nae tungvaw a la cyipaw kha thuasah, <verse number="6" style="v" />te Reuben ccapaw Eliab, Eliab ccapaw hae Dathan te Abiram tungvaw a cyipaw, mih innbyn hae ryte, mih bu hae, mih phu kya umpaw a hysuepaw miakaw kha Israel balyn laku kya pawtemou laephi nynh a khalang aw zah a laang hae cipaw kha thuasah atunin liathuitua oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31-32">Nam 16.31-32</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a cyipaw ryalaw lepaw miakaw kha nae mit ccaccei nynh a muih vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atunin kaw kae pya cih oh paw hynh-e kawbya abalyn hynh zui oh, tuhteze nynh ccou khylan na ccianua cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang tee lan te ccou lan thawzung na hoi cih oh zah, <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae minpaaw hae te mih ciihan hae kha pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram, mateitui te khoitui aluanaw ram kya nae hiinshe asae cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize ccou khylan na tee vae cih oh paw ram tuh na pounaw oh Izip ram, enaw-tuiho khokhu hawte nae ccacii na ccou oh zah ccu te tui na bunaw oh ram hawte thua khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama ccou khylan na ccianua cih oh paw ram tuh mua hae te accya hae um zah vaawlui kyate khuaatui te bupaw ram, <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a do-oihpaw ram nynh thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia mit nynh kum athonaw te athangnaw cia zungzae a dopaw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw kawbya miakaw—<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha sungsahnaw, nae thinlung balyn te nae tuanaw balyn te amaw hanlan ryalawpyanaw—kha na zui oh zetuh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:3-5">Lev 26.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-16">Deu 7.12-16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28.1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />nae ram hanlan khuaatui kha amaw accyh kya, masaty e khua te nyalang e khua kha ae pya cih oh, te nae ccathae, nae misutui te nae chitui kha na suelua cih oh; <verse number="15" style="v" />nae sahiin-awvaw hanlan nae loo hae kya lonua ae posahpah cih oh zah, phe byn lan na ae cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Raeringkuh oh, tuhkhyhze tuh ahme leipaw laanpi kalan soih na thua cih oh zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha ryalawpyate na beiksei cih oh, <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhte na cyi oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw nynh maee lang ae ruanua cih oh zah, khuaa akan cih zah, ram nynh athae kha a pousah khyh nawlan vaawlui kha a khawsung cih; tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram hoypaw kya arangte na roh vae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hynh-e ka bya hae hynh nae thinlung kya te nae tuanaw kya na nung cih oh, te nae kuih kyakhe muihsahnaw lante na khiidekuh cih oh zah nae terui kya syntawnaw lante na heedekuh cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />E bya hae hynh nae ccaaw hae kha ccangpah oh lah, innvaw na um oh ze thuasah, laansaw lang na um oh ze thuasah, na hueku oh ze thuasah, na thoku oh ze thuasah hynh-e bya hae kong hynh hopah oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nae inn thuakaw tung hae kya te nae koikua hae kya zei oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:6-9">Deu 6.6-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae minpaaw hae pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram kya, vaawlui tuh laephi luki a um lungkhu balyn, nae hiinshe te nae ccaaw hae hiinshe tuh asae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha sungsahte, a laanpi balyn kha zuite, amaw kha tynkaring lan kyngkute, kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e kawbya balyn hynh zuakute na zui oh zetuh, <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e minphuin hae balyn hynh nae malang te a dee cih hae zah, nanning laeze ale huapaw te athunghuapaw minphuin hae kha na dee cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nae ccu nynh a synaw hmin miakaw tuh nae kya-e athua cih; nae ram tuh ramkaw kyate Lebanon cia, Zufrates vaw kyate Niccaw lang e Rili cia athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:3-5">Jos 1.3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah nanning rawsete ae thadynnua kho lan khyh oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte, nae ccu nynh a synaw ram balyn kyakhe nanning rhaw kha rinaw te thyngkunaw kha a nung cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dotua, atunin nanning malang hythuanaw te thyalawnaw kha ka nung: <verse number="27" style="v" />atunin kaw kae pya oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae kha na zui oh zetuh, hythuanaw athua cih; <verse number="28" style="v" />te na ny boi lei oh paw ccangpaw pachia hae kha zui khylan atunin kaw kae pya oh paw laanpi kyate maekute, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae kha na zui khyh oh zetuh, thyalawnaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ccou khylan na teenua cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh he ae teekhae vae oh te, hythuanaw kha Gerizim Mua vawlan na nung cih oh zah, thyalawnaw kha Ebal Mua vawlan na nung cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:11-14">Deu 27.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Jos 8.33-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Na ny oh hawte, tuh-e mua hae tuh Jordan vaw khuraw lang, niccaw lang te beihtaraw asawnaw, Arabah kya um hae paw Kanaan hae ram kya, Gilgal te arawsekunaw, Moreh kya-e rantah thing hae pe nynh a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kha teenuate ccou khylan Jordan vaw kha na zua oh zah, khah-e ram kha ccoute tuin kya khua he na sah oh te, <verse number="32" style="v" />atunin nae malang ka nungpaw phungbya hae te phungzae hae balyn hynh zuakute na zui hahe cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beiknaw Hmin San Kheit kyalya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh laephi vawlan na hiin lungkhu oh balyn ccou lan ae pya oh paw ram kya zuakute na zui lan oh paw phungbya hae te phungzae hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning nynh na lah vae cih oh paw minphuin hae nynh mua ahang hae paw vawlan, sangpyng hae vawlan te anaw abungpaw thingku kaw miakaw kya a beik hae paw mih pachia hae hmin balyn kha pong na ropah cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih silawhang hae kha phoupah oh, mih lungpum hae kha ropah oh, mih Asherim kha maee te upah oh lah, mih pachia lang a raeku hae paw zohtuh hae kha baepah oh, tuhcite mih umnaw hmin hae kyate mih min kha thee oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:5">Deu 7.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha tuhcite na beik lan khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a min nung nawlan te a um nawlan nae phin balyn kyate a po cih paw hmin kha na ccung cih oh. Tuh-e hmin kalan na cceih cih oh zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />nae kya-e maee-ute silawnawpaw hae te silawnawpaw hae, nae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit hae te nae kya-e ahlu hae, byakinkute na pya oh paw nae lasung hae, lungthote na pya oh paw silawnawpaw hae, te nae vaetua phu te nae tuuphu kya-e thanty hae kha tuh-e hmin kalan na thuakhae cih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te nanning nynh tuin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe na ae cih oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hythua ae pya oh zah na cyi oh paw miakaw kya nanning te nae innbyn hae tuh pynkheihlan nae lungtua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aening balyn nynh ahmaw rynaw thyhte atunin hein kya ah cyi oh hawte na cyih lan khyh oh, <verse number="9" style="v" />pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw haeungnaw te rho lungkhu lang na tee loh khyh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan vaw zuate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae nee oh paw ram kya na um oh zah, khyndadyh lan khua na sah oh ccaw cite nae pepan umpaw nae rhaw hae kyate haeungnaw he ae pya oh te, <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a min um nawlan a popaw hmin kalan khe kaw kae pya oh paw atyn-are kha na cciakhae cih oh: nae kya-e maee-ute silawnawpaw hae te nae silawnawpaw hae, nae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit hae te nae kya-e ahlu hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bya na kinku thyh oh te na pya oh paw lasung balyn kha na thuakhae cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe naemaw ryte nae ccanung hae te nae ccapaw hae, nae seenung hae te nae seepaw hae, te neekupaw thuasah, rho thuasah hoi leite nae khua kya a um hae paw Levi hae ryte nae lungtua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hopyapaw Beiknaw Hmin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na muih oh paw hmin miakaw kya nae kya-e maee-ute silawnaw kha na rae khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama nae phin hae kya-e phinkhakheit kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kya kyalya khe nae kya-e maee-ute silawnaw kha na rae cih oh zah kaw kae pya oh paw atyn-are kha tuin kya na cyih cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw hythuanaw thyhte nae khua khuakhakheit kya na ry takyh oh te, saw kha na chiakuh cih oh zah na ae cih oh; sazuh te sakhi kha leih a ae hae hawte athyaapaw ccungccaw nynh thuasah, athyaa leipaw ccungccaw nynh thuasah tuh-e tuh a ae cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama chii kha na ae lan khyh oh; tuh-e chii tuh laephi kya tui hawte na lae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Gen 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">Deu 15.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Nae ccathae, nae misutui te nae chitui pumhaw pumkheit kha thuasah, nae vaetua phu te nae tuuphu kya-e thanty hae kha thuasah, bya na kinku oh paw byakinnaw lasung hae, lungthote na pya oh paw silawnawpaw hae hankhakheit kha thuasah, nae kya-e ahlu hae kha thuasah nae khua lungkhu kya na ae lan khyh oh; <verse number="18" style="v" />hynh-e hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a popaw hmin kya namaw ryte na ccanung te na ccapaw, na seenung hae te na seepaw hae, te nae khua kya umpaw Levi phin hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe na ae cih oh, na cyi oh paw balyn kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang nae lungtua cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae ram kya na um lungkhu oh balyn, Levi phin hae kha pawlangria leite na um khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte nae ram kha he ae kosahpah oh te, nanning nynh saw na ae ry keiccu oh ze, “Saw ka ae cih,” na ci oh ze, na ry takyh oh te saw kha na ae cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a min nung nawlan a popaw hmin tuh nanning kyate myaryamaw asaw lanze, kaw kae pya vae oh hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae pya oh paw vaetua phu khyhze tuuphu kya-e sakhakheit kha na theih cih oh zah, na ry takyh oh te, nae khua lungkhu kya na ae cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Sazuh saw thuasah, sakhi saw thuasah na ae oh hawte na ae cih oh; athyaa leipaw ccungccaw nynh mah, athyaapaw ccungccaw nynh mah a ae cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Chii kha papin na ae lan khyh oh; pawccecize chii tuh hiinnaw thua zah, hiinnaw kha asaw ryte na aede lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.23-24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lev 17.10-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Chii kha na ae lan khyh oh zah laekhu langkhe tui hawte na lae cih oh. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mitmuihnaw kya ahmepaw kha na cyi keiccu oh ze naemaw te nae nukhu e nae ccaaw hae tuh ngedang lungpawte na um ccaw oh, chii kha ae nan oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama na pya lan oh paw athyaapaw ahlu hae te bya na kinku oh thyhte na pya oh paw lasung hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kalan khe na thuakhae cih oh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Maee-ute si na lawnaw oh paw asaw te achii kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia silawhang vawlan khe na pya cih oh; ccangpaw si na lawnaw oh paw achii hae kha tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia silawhang pe khe na lae cih oh, thuasalama asaw kha tuh na ae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia mitmuihnaw kya ahoypaw te ahmepaw kha na cyih oh zah, naemaw te nae nukhu e nae ccaaw hae tuh ngedang lungpawte zungzae na um ccaw oh, atunin kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e bya hae hynh hoyte zui oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh Beiknaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Law lan na teenua vae cih oh paw minphuin hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae malang khe maemih hae zah minmin kha lawte mih ram kya he na um oh te, <verse number="30" style="v" />minmin kha nae malang khe ro athua kou hae te, minmin kaheih lawkute kaang na kae khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh: “E minphuin hae nynh mih pachia hae kha pawtepei a beik hae? Kae mah minmin hawte cyi ka rybua,” cite mih pachia hae te asekuh lante akaw-aleih khia nan oh. <verse number="31" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan minmin hawte na cyih lan khyh oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a huapaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw miakaw kha minmin nynh mih pachia hae hanlan a cyipya hae. Minmin nynh mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae kha heize mih pachia hae hanlan maee kya leih a u hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kaw kae pya oh paw atyn-are kha zuakute na zui hahe cih oh; khah-e kyakhe na biachih lan khyh oh zah na lahbang lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Deu 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Bya 22.18-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning laku te profeh hae te maanleihthya hae paw yn langkuh hae zah syntawnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae kha nanning kya muihsahte, <verse number="2" style="v" />ae langsahpyaku oh paw muihsahnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae tuh yn cyihkuh zah, na ny boi lei oh paw “Ccangpaw pachia hae kha zui oh sih lah beik oh sih,” cite ae hopya oh zetuh, <verse number="3" style="v" />tuh-e profeh hae te maanleihthya hae paw bya kha na ngaepah lan khyh oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha nae thinlung balyn te nae tuanaw balyn te na sungsah ccaccing oh tou cipaw ny khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha ae syntawtua cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na zui cih oh, amaw kyalya kha na rih cih oh, a kawbya hae kha na zui cih oh, a roi kha na ngae cih oh, amaw kha na beik cih oh zah amaw kha tynkaring lan na kyngkuh cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama Izip ram kyate ae poukhae oh zah seetangnaw kyate ae shawkhaw oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw rawsete, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh zui lan kaw ae pya oh paw laanpi kyate nanning kha maeleihsahku khylan lungzi leinaw bya a ho keiccu hae ze, tuh-e profeh hae te maanleihthya hae paw tuh chia athua cih hae. Tukeiccuze nanning laku kyate hoyleinaw kha na vua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na uno, na paaw ccapaw khyhze na nung ccapaw, na ccapaw khyhze na ccanung, na pompaw na zu, na naekuh hua oh paw na banpaw nynh heize, namaw nynh thuasah, na minpaaw hae nynh thuasah na ny lei oh paw pachia hae kalan, “Cceih oh sih lah ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik oh sih,” cite ho hae zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />na pepan anaenaw te asawnaw, laephi voikheit lang te voikheit lang adianaw kyacia a um hae paw ccungccaw hae pachia hankhakheit kha beik khylan aruh lante ae hyy hae ze thuasah, <verse number="8" style="v" />na nawccawkhae lan khyh zah tuhcihawpaw ccungccaw hae bya kha na ngae lan khyh. Minmin tungvaw thawccinaw te ngaethyaumsahnaw na langsakuh lan khyh zah na pankhaw lan khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Minmin kha na theih ccaccing cih hae; minmin chia khylan na kuih tuh masaty na hang cih zah, tukoute ccungccaw balyn nynh mih kuih a hang cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Izip ram seetangnaw kyate ae poukhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kyate nanning kha maeleihsahku khylan a zuaku keiccu hae ze, lung te phe chih lan deih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Israel balyn nynh a thae cih hae zah a rih cih hae, te tuhcihawpaw hoyleinaw kha kharouh cyih vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh um nawlan ae pya oh paw khua khuakhakheit kyakhe, <verse number="13" style="v" />ccungccalei hae paw nynh nanning laku kyate cceih hae zah khua kya a um hae paw kyakhe, “Cceih oh sih lah ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik oh sih,” cite na ny lei oh paw pachia hae kong a ho hae paw kha na thae oh zetuh, <verse number="14" style="v" />nanning nynh akaw-aleih hoyte na khia cih oh. Nanning laku kya tuhcite anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae tuh acyiku ccaccing zetuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />tuh-e khua kya a um hae paw kha thaloi te na theih cih oh zah, tuh-e khua te a lungkhu umpaw atyn-are, sahiin-awvaw hae kha thaloi te pong na theih cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na luade oh paw uccaw balyn kha khualae angaelung khe na ccakhung cih oh; oute khua te khua lungkhu e na luade oh paw balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan abalynte maee-ute silawnaw lante maee te na u cih oh. Tuh-e tuh zungzae arohpaw khua athua vae cih zah, papinmaw raethui thua vae lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh myarya lepaw a thinrianaw kyate paleihkuh zah nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinku hawte ngaethya ae umsah oh zah ae pungthung sah nawlan oh, ro athua vae paw uccaw ccangkheit sanmah nae kuih te na ty lan khyh oh, <verse number="18" style="v" />atunin kaw kae pya oh paw a kawbya balyn kha na zui oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia roi kha na ngae oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia mitmuihnaw kya ahmepaw kha cyih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia ccaaw hae nynh na thua oh. Michi hanlan nae ngesaw na awkuh lan khyh oh, nae mitteky laku e nae ming kha na ngokuh lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lev 19.28</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 21:5">21.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan athyaapaw minphuin nynh na thua oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha laephi vawlan e ccungccaw balyn kyate a ccungccaw hae lang te aphutepaw lang ae poku vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Exo 19.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Deu 4.20</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26.18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Pe 2.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Athyaapaw te Athyaa leipaw Looh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Lev 11.1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw miakaw na ae lan khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ae lan oh paw sarangpaw hae tuh: vaetua, tuu, miaa, <verse number="5" style="v" />sazuh, sakhi, sathaw, sazaw, saccung, ramkaw vaetua te mua tuu nynh thua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Accumakeih phiakuh zah a ccutin asaepaw sarangpaw miakaw te sarangpaw hae lakuze akhaethuipaw kha na ae cih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama akhaethuipaw te accumakeih aphiakuhpaw kyaze na ae lei lan oh paw tuh: kalauh, saveih te sangepavo nynh thua hae, pawccecize hynh-e hae tuh a khaethui hae zemah mih ccumakeih phiakuh khyh zah nae hanlan thyaa khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te voh tuh accumakeih aphiaku zemah a khaethui khyh keiccuze nae hanlan thyaa khyh. A saw kha na ae lan khyh oh, achihpaw kha mah na ty lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui lungkhu a umpaw balyn kyaze asake te aphaluh a hoipaw miakaw kha na ae cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te asake te aphaluh a hoi leipaw miakaw kha na ae lan khyh oh; tuh-e tuh nae hanlan athyaa leipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Athyaapaw pavaw miakaw kha na ae kho oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama na ae lei lan oh paw tuh: mosi, lantaw, ngasathypaw pavaw, <verse number="13" style="v" />mosipi, mosi phuin miakaw; <verse number="14" style="v" />va-aw phuin miakaw; <verse number="15" style="v" />kalauh pavaw, butharu, rili pavaw, mosi phuin miakaw; <verse number="16" style="v" />vaphouh, nawniapi, tui-aw <verse number="17" style="v" />te pelikan pavaw, sathuh aepaw lantaw, tui-pavaw, <verse number="18" style="v" />kaepaw-pavaw, varaw phuin miakaw; michi pavaw te balaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te asake a hoipaw ripawhaepaw miakaw tuh nae hanlan thyaa khyh zah na ae lan khyh oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Sake hoi zah athyaapaw ahysuepaw miakaw tuh na ae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaw chi lan achihpaw miakaw kha na ae lan khyh oh; tuh-e tuh nae khua umpaw ramccang hae nynh a ae ccaw hae na pya kho oh, tuhkhyhze tuh-e tuh ramccang hae kalan na zuapah kho oh. Pawccecize nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan athyaapaw minphuin nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Exo 23.19</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Miaa taraw kha a pi mateitui te na thungde lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pumhaw Pumkheit Phungzae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum takyh loo kyate apoupaw nae ccacii-emung kyate na mue oh paw looh balyn kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha ccangte phia oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.22-29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lev 27.30-33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nam 18.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw rithyanaw kha zungzae na ny nawlan oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw min a um nawlan a po cih paw hmin kyakhe nae ccathae, nae misutui, nae chitui kya-e pumhaw pumkheit te nae vaetua phu te nae tuuphu kya-e thanty kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe na ae cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hythuanaw he ae pya oh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw min um nawlan a popaw hmin tuh nanning kyate ccialekunaw myaryamaw saw zah pumhaw pumkheit kha na cciakhae kho khyh oh ze, <verse number="25" style="v" />phua lang na rulae cih oh zah, phua kha nae kuih kya khyndadyh lan ccyngte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a popaw hmin kalan na cciakhae cih oh; <verse number="26" style="v" />tuh-e phua tuh na ry oh paw miakaw kya—vaetua hae, tuu hae, misutui, ruimangpaw niapaw khyhze na ry oh paw miakaw kya na mang cih oh. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe nae innbyn hae ryte lungpawte pynkheihlan na ae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nae khua kya umpaw Levi hae kha pawlangria leite na um lan khyh oh, pawccecize minmin tuh nanning kya neekupaw thuasah, rho thuasah hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kum thumnaw takyh khe tuh-e kum kya na voisah oh paw looh pumhaw pumkheit kha phe ccing lan na thuakhae cih oh zah, nae khua lungkhu khe na ccakhung cih oh; <verse number="29" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh na law oh paw ryalaw balyn kya hythua ae pya nawlan oh, nanning kya neekupaw thuasah, rho thuasah a hoi lei hae paw Levi phin hae tuh nae khua kya um hae paw ramccang hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae ryte oun cceih cih hae zah phe byn lan a ae cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sabbath Kum Upadi hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lev 25.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sarinaw kum takyh kya laebah ngaethyakunaw na rae cih oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te laebah ngaethyakunaw konglang tuh hynhcite athua cih: laebah a koiisakuhtupaw miakaw nynh a koiitupaw a innpaw kha a ngaethya cih, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e ngaethyakunaw tuh thaesahku athua keiccu vae ze, amaw uno athuapaw a innpaw kyate tuh-e laebah tuh ngia lan khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ramccang ccungccaw kha tuh laebah na ngia kho, thuasalama na uno lukhakheit nynh ae koipaw laebah kha tuh na ngaethya hahe cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning laku aryachipaw lu kheit sanmah um lan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ccou khylan ae pya cih oh paw ram kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua ae pya ccaccing cih oh, <verse number="5" style="v" />atunin kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e kawbya balyn hynh zuakute na zui oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kaw kha na ngae oh zetuh, hythua ae pya ccaccing cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte, hythuanaw he ae pya oh te, minphuin patae hae kha na koiisakuh cih oh, thuasalama nanning nynh na koi lan khyh oh; minphuin patae hae kha na uk cih oh, thuasalama minmin nynh nanning kha ae uk lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw ram lungkhu e khua hae kyakhe a ryachipaw nae uno lukhakheit a um lanze, a ryachipaw nae innpaw paw tungvaw kya nae sithah lan khyh zah nae kuihphe kha phang na huh lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lev 25.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Nae kuihphe kha na daw cih oh zah, pawpaw athua zemah, a ryachipaw hanlan phe azaw lan hysahte na koiisakuh cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kum sarinaw, ngaethyakunaw kum anae vae,” cite tuate aryachipaw na innpaw paw tungvaw eiungnaw hoite pawpaw mah pya leite ahoy leipaw thinlung kha na hoi khyh nawlan raeringkuh; nae innpaw paw nynh nanning rawsete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a sia cih zah, seinaw mee kha na teing cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaw kha hysahte pya lah, na pya vae ze, na sithah nan sah, pawccecize hynh-e konglang kyahin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh na ryalaw balyn kya te na cyipaw balyn kya hythua ae pya cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephi vawlan aryachipaw ccungccaw tuh thang boi lan khyh, tukeiccuze kae nynh nanning kha, “Nae ram kya umpaw a ryachipaw te ahoboupaw nae innpaw hanlan nae kuihphe kha daw oh,” cite kaw kae pya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:11">Mat 26.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:7">Mar 14.7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:8">Joh 12.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae uno, Hebru paw thuasah, Hebru nung thuasah nanning kalan zua thua zah kum taruh lungkhu rya ae lawpya ze, kum sarinaw kum kyakhe tuh-e ccungccaw kha na luesah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lev 25.39-46</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te namaw kyate na luesahpaw seepaw lu kheit kha he na saw te, a kuih ccakaete na saw lan khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tuuphu kya-e thuasah, na huimin kya-e thuasah, na misu mianaw khu kya-e thuasah hysahte na pya cih, tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh hythua ae pyapaw thyhte amaw kha pyatua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram kya see lang na la tang oh paw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae shawkhaw oh paw kha liathui oh; tukeiccuze atunin hynh-e kaw hynh nanning kae pya oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh na kya a umpaw kha a sawccah zah nang te na innbyn kha a sungsah keiccuze nang kha, “Na kyate ka pou lan khyh,” ae cipya ze, <verse number="17" style="v" />sivaw ccungthy kha na lah cih zah thuakaw kyakhe a nakua kha po ua lan na vih cih, te na see lang zungzae a tang vae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">Na seenung kha mah tuhcite na cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kyate minmin kha luesahte he na saw hae te, tuh-e tuh aru cite tua nan, pawccecize minmin nynh nang kha hohpaw ryalahtu kya-e ryalaw mee te atekuhpaw ryalaw kha kum taruh lungkhu phe ae lawpya vae hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh na cyipaw balyn kya hythua ae pya cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sahiin-awvaw Thanty</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na vaetua phu te na tuuphu kya-e thanty pise miakaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan na thyaasah cih; na vaetua phu kya-e thanty khate rya na lah lan khyh zah na tuuphu kya-e thanty kha a ming na ngo lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:12">Exo 13.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e thanty hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kyakhe nang te na innbyn hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe kum takyh na aekheih cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e thanty tuh douccaw leinaw ccangkhakheit—ccu khyanaw, mitmohnaw tahawpaw douccaw leinaw alepaw a hoi lanze, tuh-e tuhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan si na law lan khyh; <verse number="22" style="v" />tuh-e tuh nae khua lungkhu khe na ae cih oh, sakhi te sazuh na ae oh hawte athyaapaw te athyaa leipaw ccungccaw nynh pynkheihlan a ae cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama a chii kha na ae lan khyh oh; laekhu langkhe tui hawte na lae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Gen 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Deu 12.16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawtaw Poi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Exo 12.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan kawtaw poi kha tua oh lah, Abib sawpaw kha naawsah oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha Izip ram kyate Abib saw, khuazi khe ae poukhae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lev 23.5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Nam 28.16-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a min a um nawlan a po cih paw hmin kyakhe tuuphu kya-e te thuasah, vaetua phu kya-e te thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan kawtaw poi silawnaw kha na rae cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ransi phingkuhpaw hankhakheit te na ae dee lan khyh oh. Izip ram kyate vawsawnaw te arangte nae pou keiccu oh ze, nin sari lungkhu ransi phing leipaw sanlou, vawsawnaw sanlou khate na ae dee cih oh, tuhteze nynh Izip ram kyate nae toiku nin oh kha nae hiin lungkhu balyn na ning lan khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nae ram balyn kya nin sari lungkhu ransi kha nae kya muih thua lan khyh; masaty nin zete kya na chia oh paw saw kha awkhualan awkhua cia na laesah lan khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw nae khua hae lungkhu kya kawtaw poi silawnaw rae lan ua na thua khyh oh. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw min a um nawlan a po cih paw hmin kya kyalya khe, Izip ram kyate na pou ccyh oh, khuanin ccaw ccyh zetepakaw khe kawtaw poi silawnaw kha na rae cih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a po cih paw hmin kyakhe ang na hyng cih oh zah na ae cih oh; awkhualan awkhua khe nae bu kalan na ki cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nin taruh lungkhu ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha na ae cih oh zah nin sarinaw nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan athyaapaw pumkunaw na rae cih oh, tuh-e nin kya rya na lah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Loohrue Poi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Exo 34.22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Athadynpaw ccathae kha rungkou te he na rue takaw oh te, lonaw naw sari na ria cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Nam 28.26-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kyate na mue oh paw hythuanaw alung azya thyhte, lungthote silawnawpaw kha thuakhaete, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan lonaw poi kha na tua cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw min a um nawlan a po cih paw hmin kyakhe, naemaw, nae ccapaw hae te nae ccanung hae, nae seenung hae te nae seepaw hae, nae khua kya umpaw Levi phin hae, nanning laku e mikhia hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe nae lungtua sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Izip ram kya see lang na la tang oh paw kha liathui oh lah, hynh-e phungbya hae hynh zuakute zui oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bu Poi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lev 23.33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae huimin te nae misu mianaw khu kyate apoupaw kha he na ccakhung kou oh te, nin sari lungkhu bu poi kha na tua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.13-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Nam 29.12-38</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Naemaw, nae ccapaw hae te nae ccanung hae, nae seepaw hae te nae seenung hae, nae khua kya um hae paw Levi phin hae, mikhia hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae nynh poi na tua lya oh khe nae lungtua sah. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kyakhe nin sari lungkhu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan poi na tuapah cih oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae looh na voisah oh paw balyn kya te na cyi oh paw balyn kya hythua ae pya cih keiccu oh ze, poi kha na tua ccaccing cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pise balyn nynh ransi phing leipaw sanlou poi, lonaw poi te bu poi kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kyakhe kum kheit ze vae thum a langkuh cih hae. Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe kuih ccakaete langkuh lan khyh hae; <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw hythuanaw thyhte ccungccaw balyn nynh mih taeningnaw thyhte a pya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byapiatu hae te Uktu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw nae khua balyn kyakhe byapiatu hae te bawi hae kha nae phin takyh kya na khang cih oh zah minmin nynh ccungccaw hae hanlan ahmepaw byapaenaw kha a raepah cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahme lei lante bya na pia lan khyh; ccungccaw mae na do lan khyh; pyaruh kha na lawkuh lan khyh, pawccecize ahme leipaw lasung nynh ahawpaw mit kha mohsah zah midingpaw bya kha a paleihsahku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Exo 23.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kha ccoute na hiin nawlan oh, byadingpaw kyalya kha na zui cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan na rae oh paw silawhang pe khe pawpaw thingku kha mah Asherah zohtuh tung lante na bing lan khyh oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:13">Exo 34.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh a huapaw lungbing kha na bing lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Douccah leipaw te accing leinaw ccangkhakheit a umpaw vaetua khyhze tuu khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan silawnaw na rae lan khyh oh; pawccecize tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan anungsikuhpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw nae khua kyakhe nopi khyhze pise nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia mitmuihnaw kya hoyleinaw rae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakinnaw kha zui leite, <verse number="3" style="v" />kae khee oh paw ccangpaw pachia hae, khuanin thuasah, sawpaw thuasah, vaawlang umpaw ccangkhakheit kha thuasah ryalawpyate a beikpaw kha,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Exo 22.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />nanning kya hopya athua ze thuasah, na thae oh ze thuasah, akaw-aleih na khia oh zah, Israel hae kya tuhcihawpaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw cyi athua ccaccingpaw kha nanning laku kya muih athua zetuh, <verse number="5" style="v" />tuh-e hoyleinaw a raepaw nopi khyhze pise tuh nae koikua kalan na poukhae cih oh zah, lung te phe chih lan na deih cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />A nyhtu ccaekia lu ning khyhze lu thum a um ze, chia athua cih; ccaekia lu kheit kyalya a um ze, chia thua lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Nam 35.30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Deu 19.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2Ko 13.1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1Ti 5.19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Heb 10.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw kha chia khylan a nyhtu ccaekia hae nynh masaty mih kuih a hang cih hae, tukoute ccungccaw balyn nynh mih kuih a hang cih hae. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku te ccikan athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">1Ko 5.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw Byapaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw chiakunaw kong, kaethekunaw kong te ziaku buakunaw kong, tuhcihawpaw byalungnaw ccangkhakheit kha nae khua kya um zah, nae hanlan byapaenaw rae lan myaryamaw aru lanze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a popaw hmin kalan arangte na cceih cih oh zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />tuh ccyh lyaze byapiatu rya a lahtu te Levi phin ranpibawi hae kalan na thuakhae cih oh zah, minmin nynh tuh-e kong byapaenaw kha ae thaesah cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kyate nanning kalan ae thaesah oh paw byapaenaw kha hmerarih lan zui oh lah, minmin nynh ae ccangpya oh paw atyn-are kha zuakute zui oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning hanlan ae ccaesahpya oh paw upadi te ae hopya oh paw byapaenaw kha phe ccing lan na cyih cih oh; minmin nynh ae thaesah oh paw byapaenaw kyate voilang ranglang maekuh nan oh. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan ryalawpya lan khang athuapaw ranpibawi khyhze byapiatu bya kha ngae leite a cyih nganpaw tuh a chih cih. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha Israel kyate na ccikan cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh a thae hae te, a rih cih hae zah bua cyih ngan vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Kawhoinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang teete na ccou oh zah tuin kya khua na sah oh te, nanning nynh, “Kae pepan umpaw minphuin balyn hawte oun uktu lang siapharan kha kae khangkuh cih,” cite he na ci oh te,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Sa 8.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a po cih paw siapharan kha nanning uk khylan na khangkuh ccaccing cih oh. Nae uno hae kya-e lu kheit kha nanning uk khylan siapharan lang na khangkuh cih oh; nae uno athua leipaw ramccangpaw kha nanning uktu lang na khangkuh kho khyh oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e siapharan nynh amaw hanlan marang patae hoi lan khyh, marang houh lung lan hoi khylan Izip ram lang ccungccaw hae kha kisah lan khyh hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha, “Tuh-e laanpi kalan kharouh na kithui vae lan khyh oh,” ae cipya vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:28">1Si 10.28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:16">2Sh 1.16</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 9:28">9.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e siapharan nynh zu patae hoi lan khyh, a thinlung paleihkuh lan khyh; sui te ngun kha mah amaw hanlan pataepi hoi lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-22">1Si 10.14-22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 10:27">27</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">11.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:15">2Sh 1.15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 9:27">9.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />A peenaw kya-e siapharan haungnaw kya he a haung te, Levi phin ranpibawi hae kya umpaw, amaw hanlan zei athuapaw e upadi hynh a khawpikuh cih. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia rawrinaw kha a ccangkuh cih zah, hynh-e upadi te phungbya kya-e bya balyn kha zuakute a zui nawlan, tuh-e phungbya tuh amaw kya tyty a um cih zah a lungkhu umpaw kha a hiin lungkhu balyn a ria cih, <verse number="20" style="v" />amaw te a ciihan hae nynh Israel ram kya a peenaw kha khaw cia a uk nawlan hae, ccangpaw a uno hae tungvaw lysakuh lan khyh zah, kawbya kyate voilang ranglang maekuh lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi te Levi Phin hae Hanpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi phin ranpibawi hae, Levi phin balyn tuh neekupaw uccaw khyhze rho kha Israel laku kya hoi lan khyh hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanpaw silawnawpaw hae kha a ae kho hae, <verse number="2" style="v" />thuasalama mih uno hae laku kya rho kha hoi lan khyh hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinpyaku hae thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh mih rho nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Nam 18.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hynh-e hynh ccungccaw hae nynh si a lawnaw hae paw vaetua khyhze tuu kyate ranpibawi hae nynh a ccou lan hae paw athua cih: minmin nynh ranpibawi kalan alya, akhaw ccangning te avuepi kha a pya cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Masaty na rue oh paw nae ccathae, nae misutui, nae chitui te na ngo ty oh paw nae tuuming kha amaw kalan na pya cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh Levi te a ccapaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te thadyn khylan te ryalaw khylan nae phin balyn kyate zungzae hanlan a po vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi phin lukhakheit nynh a la umnaw Israel ram, nae khua khuakhakheit kyate yn pou zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kalan (thua a ry takyhte yn thua kho zah), he yn thua lanze, <verse number="7" style="v" />tuh-e hmin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang ryalaw khylan a thadyn hae paw a ruiban Levi phin balyn hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia min te rya a lah cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />aning tuh innbyn rho hae zuanaw kyate a muepaw uccaw a hoi zemah, aning nynh a hanpaw ae lanpaw kha alokuh lante a muebua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccaaw te Silawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang he na tee oh te, tuin ram e minphuin hae kya-e anungsikuhpaw cyisahnaw kha thy na dokuh lan khyh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning laku kya a ccapaw khate thuasah, a ccanung khate thuasah maee te si a lawkuhpaw, apawepaw, beidin hothyapaw, kuihdothyapaw, mitleihthyapaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19.26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:18">Exo 22.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />naawthyapaw, khozi bahkuhpaw, chihiinleihthyapaw lu kheit sanmah na um lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e hae acyihthya hae paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan anungsikuhpaw nynh thua hae; hynhcihaw anungsikuhpaw cyisahnaw keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh minmin kha nae malang te a dee cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang lungzi hae paw ccaccing na thua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5.48</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Na dee cih oh paw minphuin hae nynh beidin hothyapaw te apawepaw bya kha a ngae hae zemah, nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh tuhcite cyi lan ae ua khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moses te Alokuhpaw Profeh Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kamaw yn lopaw profeh lu kheit kha nae hanlan naemaw minphuin kyate yn pousah cih zah, tuh-e profehbya kha na ngae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:22">Loc 3.22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:37">7.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />E hynh Horeb kya na pumku nin oh ze, nanning nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia roi kha bua ka thae ung ze thuasah, hynh-e maee lepaw hynh bua ka muih ung ze thuasah ka chih cih,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan na ngia oh paw kha nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Minmin nynh a ho hae paw tuh akyhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih uno hae kyate nang ae lopaw profeh lu kheit kha minmin hanlan ka langsakuh cih; ka bya hae kha tuh-e profeh khalang kyakhe ka nung cih zah aning nynh kaw ka pyapaw atyn-are kha minmin kya a hopah cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e profeh nynh ka min te a hopaw bya a ngae leipaw lukhakheit kha kamaw ccaccei nynh bya a ngae khyhnaw kong kha ka ngia cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Loc 3.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama kae nynh ho lan kaw ka pya leipaw bya kha ka min te a hopaw profeh thuasah, ccangpaw pachia hae min te a hopaw profeh lukhakheit thuasah a chih cih,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning nynh naemaw te naemaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho leipaw bya tuh pawtemou ah nyh kho cih oh?” cite na hoku oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Profeh lu kheit nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te ho salamah tuh-e a hopaw tuh acyiku khyhze thuasah, ahme khyhze thuasah tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho leipaw bya nynh thua. Profeh nynh a rythyte a hodepaw nynh thua; tuh-e tuh rih nan oh.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khynnaw Khuapi hae Upadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Nam 35.9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Jos 20.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kya-e minphuin hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh maemih hae zah, nanning nynh na dee oh zah mih khua hae kya te mih inn hae kya he na um oh te, <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning ccou khylan ae pya cih oh paw ram kya-e khuapi khua thum kha na phia cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw a theihtu nynh tuh-e khua khuakhakheit kalan khe a ccue ccaw cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning ccou khylan ae pya oh paw ram kha ccangthum lang na phia cih oh zah, laanpi kha na paccyn cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E hynh tuh-e khua lang ccue zah a umpaw ccungccaw a theihtupaw konglang nynh thua, tuh-e tuh huakunaw a la um lei pite ccangpaw ccungccaw kha tuaku ty leite a theihtupaw nynh thua: <verse number="5" style="v" />Lukhakheit tuh ccangpaw ccungccaw te thing nge lan ramkaw lang a cceih hae, te (minmin kya-e) lu kheit nynh thingku kha hae te a nge lyakhe, hae tuh haerakoh kyate poh kinsei zah ccangpaw ccungccaw kha a tungsei keiccuze phe a chi lanze, tuh-e a theihtupaw tuh tuh-e khuapi hae kya-e khuakhakheit kalan khe a ccue cih zah a hiin cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze tuh, minmin lu ning laku kya huakunaw a la um leipaw thua zah a theihtupaw kha chia lan accan lei pite laanpi tuh myaryamaw asaw lanze, chiise phulahtu nynh thinria lungsote a deehui cih zah he a phah te a theihsei cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khuapi khua thum kha na phia cih oh cite kaw kae pya oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae hawte, nae ram kha kosah zah, nanning pya lan cite nae minpaaw hae bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram balyn kha ae pya cih oh zah, <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha sungsahte thuasah, a laanpi zungzae zuite thuasah atunin kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e kawbya balyn hynh zuakute na zui oh zetuh, hynh-e khuapi khua thum koute ccangpaw khua thum kha na lungsah chih cih oh, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ae pya cih oh paw ram kya seinaw a hoi leipaw chii kha luasah thua lan khyh, te chiise luasahnaw mee kha nae tungvaw ccah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama lukhakheit nynh ccangpaw ccungccaw kha a hua keiccuze zya buhkhawte bua zah phe a theih koute tuh-e khuapi khuakhakheit kalan a ccue zetuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />a theihtupaw a umnaw khuapi kya-e piccan hae nynh ccungccaw a saw cih hae zah atheitupaw kha oun thuakhae cih hae, te amaw kha chia khylan chiise phulahtu kuih kalan a pya cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngaethya na umsah lan khyh oh; ngedang lungpawte na um nawlan oh, seinaw a hoi leipaw kya-e chiise mee seinaw kha Israel kyate na ccikan cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Langmaw She e Ramri hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning ccou khylan ae pya cih oh paw ram kyakhe, nae hanlan neethung athuapaw laephi kya, langmaw she e ccungccaw hae nynh a la bing hae paw nae innpaw kya-e loori kha na nue lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:17">Deu 27.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccaekia Upadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a la cyipaw hoyleinaw kong te kyngkuh zah, hoyleinaw a cyihseipaw khyhze seinaw a raepaw lukhakheit detah lanpaw tuh ccaekia lu kheit te zaw lan khyh. Ccaekia lu ning khyhze lu thum nynh a ho hae paw bya te rou nynh seibenaw tuh tynsah athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Nam 35.30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Deu 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:17">Joh 8.17</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2Ko 13.1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1Ti 5.19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Heb 10.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Huanaw thinlung a hoipaw ccaekia nynh a cyihseipaw lukhakheit kha seibe khylan yn thua lanze, <verse number="17" style="v" />lu ning maw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thuasah, tuh ccyh lyaze rya a lahpaw ranpibawi hae te byapiatu hae malang thuasah a langkuh cih hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />te byapiatu hae nynh akaw-aleih pong a khia cih hae. Ccaekiakhantu tuh ahme leipaw ccaekia thua zah, ccangpaw ccungccapaw kha rawsete ahme lei lante ccaekia a khanku lanze, <verse number="19" style="v" />ahme leipaw ccaekia nynh tuh-e ccungccapaw tungvaw cyi lan a tuaku hawte, tuh-e ahme leipaw ccaekia tungvaw khe na cyih cih oh. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku kyate na ccikan cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae nynh a thae hae te a rih cih hae zah, tuhcihawpaw hoyleinaw tuh nanning laku kya kharouh rae vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngaethyaumsah nan oh: hiinnaw hanlan hiinnaw, mit hanlan mit, haw hanlan haw, kuih hanlan kuih, ccu hanlan ccu athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Exo 21.23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:19-20">Lev 24.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5.38</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rhawtuknaw kya Zui lanpaw Phung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae kha tuk lan na cceih oh zah, marang hae, marangle hae, nanning laeze alung huapaw rhawkaw hae kha he na muih oh te, minmin kha na rih lan khyh oh; pawccecize Izip ram kyate ae poukhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kha ae umkhae oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Rhaw na tuk maw oh khe, ranpibawi nynh malang a cceih cih zah rhawkaw hae kha, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pou Israel, thaetua! Atunin nae rhaw hae kha tuk khylan na naekuh vae cih oh. Minmin keiccuze nae lungroh nan sah, rih nan oh, siikuh nan oh lah thyngkuh nan oh; <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize nanning kha taenaw pya khylan te nanning hanlan nae rhaw hae kha tukpya khylan ae cciakhae oh paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh thua,” cite a hopah cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Oute rhawbawi hae nynh rhawkaw hae kha, “Inn thawpaw sak zah Pachia kalan a ap loh leipaw a um tou? Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh a inn lang kisah, tuhkhyhze tuh rhawtuknaw kya a chihsei cih zah, milae nynh tuh-e inn tuh a thyaasah sei cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Misu khokhu kha rae salamah misu thae te a lungtuakhaekuh loh leipaw a um tou? Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh a inn lang kisah, tuhkhyhze tuh rhawtuknaw kya a chihsei cih zah milae nynh tuh-e misu thae te a lungtuakhaekuh sei cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nopi kha zu lang dy salamah umkhae loh leipaw a um tou? Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh a inn lang ki sah, tuhkhyhze tuh rhawtuknaw kya a chihsei cih zah, milae nynh tuh-e nopi tuh zu lang a umkhae sei cih,” cite a hopah cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukoute rhawbawi hae nynh rhawkaw hae kha, “A rihpaw khyhze a rawthahpaw a um tou? Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh a inn lang kisah, tuhkhyhze tuh a ban hae kha amaw hawte mih rawthyasah sei cih hae,” cite a hopah cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Rhawbawi hae nynh rhawkaw hae kha he a hopah kou hae te, rhawkaw aphuphu cciakhaetu hae kha a khang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua khuakheit kha tuk khylan he na naenuakuh oh te, ccawkunaw bya kha na thaesah ty cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nae kya-e ccawkunaw bya kha mih nawccah zah mih koikua a hung hae zetuh, tuin khua kya umpaw ccungccaw hae nynh nanning hanlan nangsekupaw ryalaw kha ae lawpah cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh nanning ryte ccawkunaw rae leite rhaw ae tuk oh zetuh, tuh-e khua kha na koihlu cih oh; <verse number="13" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh tuh-e khua kha nae kuih lungkhu lang he ae pya oh te, pise balyn kha thaloi te na bae cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama nopi hae, imua hae, sahiin-awvaw te khua kya umpaw atyn-are balyn kha naemaw hanlan luadepaw uccaw lante na lawkuh cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw nae rhaw hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw kha nae lung atuakhaekuh cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hynh-e kya umpaw minphuin hae kya-e khua hae athua leipaw, nae umnaw te myarya asawkuhpaw khua balyn kha tuhcite na cyih cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ae pya cih oh paw hynh-e ccungccaw hae khua kya umpaw ahysuepaw pawpaw mah na hiin lan khyh oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hit hae, Amor hae, Kanaan hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kaw ae pya oh hawte pong na maemih cih oh, <verse number="18" style="v" />tuhteze nynh minmin nynh mih pachia hae hanlan a la cyi hae paw anungsikuhpaw uccaw balyn kha cyi khylan ae ccangpah bua lan khyh oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw na sei lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khua khuakheit kha law khylan rhawtukte khaw cia na koihlu oh ze, thingku hae kha hae te ngete na roh lan khyh oh. Thingku hae kyate athae hae kha na loku oh zemah, thingku hae kha na nge lan khyh oh. Nanning nynh thingku hae kha koihlu lan ciate, loo kya umpaw thingku hae tuh ccungccaw zawtou athua hae? <verse number="20" style="v" />Ae lanpaw athae thae leipaw thingku nynh thua cite na ny oh paw thingku hae kyalya kha na roh cih oh; nanning te rhaw na tukkuh oh paw khua tuh a khuliaku mawlaezung koihlunaw kya mang khylan tuh-e thingku hae kha na nge cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw Chianaw Upadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning ccou khylan ae pya cih oh paw ram kya, ramkaw huataw kyakhe michi a huekuhpaw muih thua zah, hung nynh a theih cipaw ny athua khyh zetuh, <verse number="2" style="v" />nae piccan hae te nae byapiatu hae tuh michi rhua te anaekuhpaw khua kha hohsemou asaw cipaw tou khylan oun pou cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Michi rhua te anaekuh huapaw khua kya-e piccan hae nynh rya a lah boi loh leipaw, taphu mah a khankuh boi loh leipaw vaetua tohlaw kha a lah cih hae; <verse number="4" style="v" />tuin khua kya-e piccan hae nynh tuh-e tohlaw tuh loo lang pho boi leinaw te ccacii ccou boi leinaw, zungzae tui aluapaw vaw taraw kalan khe a cciakhae bung cih hae zah, tuin kyakhe a nging kha a aw cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Oute Levi ccapaw hae, ranpibawi hae tuh malang a toikuh cih hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh amaw ryalawpya khylan te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te hythuanaw pya khylan minmin kha a po vae hae, minmin byapaenaw khate byalungnaw te ziaku buakunaw balyn kha byapia athua cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Michi rhua te anaeku huanaw khua kya-e piccan balyn tuh vaw taraw kya a nging a aw hae paw tohlaw vawlan khe mih kuih a singkuh cih hae zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />“E chii hynh kae kuih nynh luasah khyh zah, e chii hanlan kaening tuh ccaekia kae thua khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na shawkhaw hae paw na ccungccaw Israel hae hynh ngaethya hae; seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise luasahpaw seinaw kha na ccungccaw Israel laku kya nung nan,” cite a ho cih hae. Tetuh chii luasahpaw seinaw kyate minmin kha ngaethya athua vae cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mitmuihnaw kya ahmepaw kha na cyi oh keiccuze, seinaw hoi leipaw chiise luasahpaw seinaw kha nanning laku kyate na thyaasah cih oh,</para>
  <para style="s1">Kyngpaw Nopi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae kha dou khylan na cceih oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh minmin kha nae kuih kya ae pya oh zah, he na kyng oh te, <verse number="11" style="v" />na kyng oh paw laku e nopi apuithyapaw kha na muih zah zu lang na ry lanze, <verse number="12" style="v" />tuh-e nopi kha na inn lang na cciakhae cih: tuh-e nopinung nynh a sang a ngokuh cih zah a kuihting a zekuh cih, <verse number="13" style="v" />na kyngbiapaw a uccaw kha a khahkuh cih, a nung te a paaw hanlan rawkhuite na inn kya sawpaw sah kheit cia a um cih; tukoute amaw kha na ikhae kho vae cih zah a vawpaw lang na tang cih, aning mah na zu lang a tang cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama amaw kha na ry vae khyh ze, phua lang zua leite alakawte na cciasah cih. Amaw kha a the na thyasah vae keiccuze see hawte na mang lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccatawccaw Thuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pise lu kheit nynh zu zuning hoi zah, zu kheit kha sungsah zah zu kheit kha sungsah khyh, te a sungsahpaw zu te a sungsah leipaw zu nynh ccapaw hae kha saahpah hae zah, a sungsah leipaw a zu ccapaw tuh a tawccaw lanze, <verse number="16" style="v" />aning nynh a rho kha a ccapaw hae kalan he a nee hae te, a sungsahpaw a zu ccapaw kha a sungsah leipaw a zu kya a saahpaw ccatawccaw athuapaw hawte ccatawccaw lang nung lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />A sungsah leipaw a zu ccapaw kha ccatawccaw nynh thua cipaw a nyh cih zah a hoipaw balyn kya-e a hanpaw leit ning kha a pya cih; pawccecize aning tuh a paaw thawzung masaty nynh thua, ccatawccaw thuanaw tuh amaw kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawngae leipaw Ccaaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a lungkhungpaw te kawngae leipaw ccapaw kha hoi zah, a nung te a paaw bya kha ngae leite a thuihei hae zemah pawlang a ria leipaw ccapaw athua lanze, <verse number="19" style="v" />a nung te a paaw nynh a kyng cih hae zah khua koikua kya um hae paw mih khua e piccan hae kalan a cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih khua e piccan hae kha, “E kae ccapaw hynh a lungkhungpaw te kawngae leipaw thua zah kae bya yn ngae khyh. A zu-aepaw ccungccaw nynh thua,” cite a hopah cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh khua kya-e pise balyn nynh amaw kha lung te phe chih lan a deih cih hae. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku kyate na thyaasah cih oh; te Israel hae balyn nynh a thae cih hae zah a rih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Upadi Aphuinphuin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh chia lan ciate detah khopaw seinaw kha rae zah amaw kha chiate thingku kya he na sae oh te, <verse number="23" style="v" />a rhua tuh thingku vawlan khuazi zidae um lan khyh; a rhua kha tuh-e nin mawkhe na uh cih oh, pawccecize thingku kya saepaw ccungccaw tuh Pachia kya-e thyalawnaw a ingpaw nynh thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ae pya cih oh paw ram kha na thusah lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal 3.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na innpaw kya-e vaetua khyhze tuu nynh laanpi a mesei ze, pekipya leite na do huataw lan khyh; a hoitupaw kalan na kikhaepah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.1-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:4-5">Exo 23.4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />A hoitupaw tuh na pe a um khyh ze thuasah, a hoitupaw kha na ny khyh ze thuasah khah-e kha na inn lang na cciakhae cih zah, a hoitupaw nynh ae ngia mawlaezung namaw kya a um cih; oute khah-e kha amaw kalan na pya cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Na innpaw kya-e lann kha mah tuhmaminte na cyih cih; na innpaw kya-e boeining kha mah tuhmaminte na cyih cih; te na innpaw nynh zosah zah na muihpaw ccangpaw hankhakheit kha mah tuhmaminte na cyih cih. Bawm leite na um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na innpaw kya-e lann khyhze vaetua nynh laanpi kya a khuliaku ze, pekipya leite na do huataw lan khyh; a thoku nawlan na bawm cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nopi nynh pise uccaw kha lawkuh lan khyh, pise nynh mah nopi uccaw kha lawkuh lan khyh; pawccecize humhung zemah tuhcihawpaw a cyihpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan anungsikuhpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thingku kya thuasah, laekhu kya thuasah ataw khyhze atui kha api nynh a rya thinpaw pavaw bu kha na thuanua ze, api kha ataw hae ryte na luade lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngedang lungpawte na um zah na hiinshe asae nawlan, ataw kyalya kha na lawkuh cih zah api kha tuh na saw cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inn thawpaw na sak ze, na inn adawkuhpaw athangnaw kyakhe athungkhawkuhpaw kha po voilu lan na rae cih; tuhkhyhze tuh tuin kyate ccungccaw a ccawsei lanze, na inn kya chiise luasahpaw seinaw kha na hoi sei cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na misu khokhu kya ccacii phuin ning na ccoude lan khyh, tuhkhyhze tuh na tupaw ccacii athae te misu khokhu kyate apoupaw balyn tuh khaleih aroh cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.9-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:19">Lev 19.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaetua te lann kha taphu khangkheihte lei na thue lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuuming te laphan law pynkheihlan kuadekuhpaw boeining kha na lawkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na thyku oh paw boei aky kypali kyakhe ccaannawpaw boei ming kha na sae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:37-41">Nam 15.37-41</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Nopi Pise Seinaw Phung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pise lukhakheit nynh zu hoi zah a ikhae koute nopinung kha ry vae khyh zah, <verse number="14" style="v" />“E nopinung hynh zu lang ka umkhae; thuasalama he ka ikhae tuh, liaccady athuanawpaw ccaekia kha ka muih khyh,” cite thethya byahote seinaw a be lanze, <verse number="15" style="v" />tuh-e liaccanung a nung te a paaw nynh liaccady a thuanawpaw ccaekia kha koikua kya um hae paw khuapi kya-e piccan hae kalan a thuakhae cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Liaccanung a paaw nynh piccan hae kyakhe: “Ka ccanung kha hynh-e pisepaw kalan zu lang ka pya salamah aning nynh ry vae khyh; <verse number="17" style="v" />atu aning nynh liaccanung tungvaw seinaw be zah, ‘Na ccanung hynh liaccady a thuanawpaw ccaekia ka muih khyh,’ a ci. Thuasalama hynh-e hynh ka ccanung liaccady athuanawpaw ccaekia nynh thua,” cite a hopah cih hae zah, liaccanung a boeining kha khua piccan hae malang khe a daw cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e khua kya-e piccan hae nynh tuh-e pisepaw kha a ko cih hae zah a bua cih hae; <verse number="19" style="v" />tuh-e pisepaw nynh Israel liaccady lu kheit kha a thethyasah keiccuze minmin nynh ngunphua shekel za kheit a rungsah cih hae (tuh-e shekel tuh liaccanung a paaw kalan a pya cih hae). Tuh-e nopinung tuh a zu lang a tang cih; pisepaw a hiin lungkhu balyn tuh-e nopinung kha mah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e sei a benawpaw tuh kyh zah, tuh-e liaccanung kyakhe liaccady athuanawpaw ccaekia kha muih athua khyh zetuh, <verse number="21" style="v" />liaccanung kha a paaw inn thuakaw kalan a cciakhae cih hae zah, khua kya umpaw pise hae nynh lung te phe chih lan a deih cih hae, pawccecize aning nynh a paaw inn kyakhe ohhuakute Israel hae kya maethya lan umpaw kha phe a cyi vae. Tuhcite nanning laku kyate hoyleinaw kha na thyaasah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Milae zu te a ihkheih hae paw pisepaw kha muih athua lanze, nopinung a ikhaepaw pisepaw te nopinung tuh, parouh mawte a chih cih hae. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku kyate na thyaasah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zu lang a dy vae hae paw liaccady kha pisepaw nynh khualae lungkhu thuanua zah a ikhae lanze, <verse number="24" style="v" />minmin kha parouh mawte tuh-e khua koikua kalan na cciakhae cih oh zah, lung te phe chih lan na deih cih oh, liaccanung tuh khua kya phang a um pite bawmnaw mue khylan a sia khyh keiccu thua zah, pisepaw tuh a innpaw zu kha a kyngde keiccu nynh thua. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku kyate na thyaasah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama zu lang a dy vae hae paw liaccanung kha pise lu kheit nynh ramkaw khe thuanua zah, nopinung kha kyngdete a ikhae lanze, nopinung a ikhaetupaw pisepaw kyalya a chih cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Liaccanung kha pawpaw mah na cyih lan khyh oh; chinaw ciate detah khonaw lanpaw seinaw kha liaccanung nynh rae khyh, pawccecize hynh-e kong hynh a innpaw kha rawse zah a theihpaw ccungccaw lukhakheit kong te nynh aloku. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh zu lang a dy vae hae paw nopinung kha ramkaw khe a kyngde keiccuze tuh-e nopinung nynh bawmnaw mue khylan sia salamah a khum lanpaw lu kheit sanmah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A dy loh lei hae paw liaccady kha pise lu kheit nynh yn thuanua zah, kyngdete a ikhaepaw kha a muihbia hae ze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.28-29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:16-17">Exo 22.16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />a ikhaetupaw pisepaw nynh liaccanung a paaw kha ngunphua shekel sung pangaw a pya cih zah, liaccanung tuh a zu lang a tang cih. Aning nynh liaccanung kha a kyngde keiccuze a hiin lungkhu balyn tuh-e nopinung kha mah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pise lukhakheit nynh a paaw zu kha zu lang umkhae lan khyh, a paaw zu kha seikhae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18.8</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20.11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:20">Deu 27.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Ccungccaw hae kyate Deenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tin koipaw nynh thuasah, a e aw athuapaw nynh thuasah a pumku hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kalan teebua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccalah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw a pumkuh hae paw kalan teebua lan khyh; a ciihan hae she hawnaw kyacia heize a pumkuh hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kalan tee lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amor ccungccaw nynh thuasah, Moab ccungccaw nynh thuasah a pumkuh hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kalan tee lan khyh. Mih ciihan hae she haw kyacia heize a pumkuh hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kalan tee lan khyh hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:1-2">Neh 13.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize Izip ram kyate nae ccia lya oh laanryng khe minmin nynh looh te sanlou khate ae cciadue khyh oh, te nanning thyalawsah khylan Mesopotamia ram e Pethor kyate Beor ccapaw Balaam kha ae hohnuaku oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Nam 22.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />(Tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh Balaam bya kha ngaepah khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae sungsah oh keiccuze, thyalawnaw kha hythuanaw lang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae paleihpya oh.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7-24:9">Nam 23.7—24.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Nae hiinshe lungkhu balyn, mih hiin hoynaw khyhze mih hoirumnaw hanlan na ccungpah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom hae kha na hua lan khyh oh, pawccecize minmin tuh nae vaeccaw hae nynh thua hae. Izip hae kha na hua lan khyh oh, pawccecize nanning tuh mih ram kya a la um hae paw ramccang hae nynh na thua oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />A saahku hae paw she thumnaw e mih ccaawno hae tuh a pumkuh hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kalan teesah kho athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rhawkawphu Ryahmin Thyaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae kha rawsete ryahmin he na tahnuaku oh te, ahoy leipaw cyisahnaw miakaw kha na sungkuh cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning laku e lukhakheit tuh khuazi ccyh kyaze pyn kyate apouthyapaw atui keiccuze athyaa leipaw lang a tang lanze, ryahmin atolang a pou cih; ryahmin lungkhu lang tee lan khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Zete ccyh yn thua te, amaw te amaw kha tui te a singkuh cih zah, khuanin ccah te, ryahmin lungkhu lang a tee cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryahmin atolang khe na ia nawlan oh paw hmin san kheit na hoi cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae zunghe lante kawpia kha na hoi cih oh; atolang khe he na eih oh te, tuh-e kawpia khate akhu na karouh cih oh, te na maeleihkuh cih oh zah nae ia kha na thei cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh nanning khum khylan te nae rhaw hae kha nae kuih kya pya khylan nae ryahmin kya a cceih bungthung, tukeiccuze aning nynh nanning laku kya anungsikuhpaw ccangkhakheit kha a muih khyh nawlan te nanning kyate a maeleihku khyh nawlan, nae ryahmin tuh athyaa hahe cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih bawi hae kyate nae kalan oun ccue hae paw see hae kha mih bawi hae kalan na pyathui lan khyh oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin tuh nae khua khuakhakheit kya a poku hae paw hmin sankhakheit, mih lungrythuanaw kyakhe nae laku kya nanning ryte a um cih hae; minmin kha na tuaa na sah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel hae kya-e ccanung hae tuh beikinn ohhuanung lang tang lan khyh hae; Israel hae kya-e ccapaw hae tuh beikinn ohhuapaw lang tang lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:29">Lev 19.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Byakinkunaw ccangkhakheit hanlan pya khylan ohhuanung mee phua khyhze ohhuapaw mee phua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia inn lungkhu lang na thuakhae lan khyh, pawccecize tuh-e hae tuh parouh mawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia hanlan anungsikuh hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae uno Israel ccungccaw tungvaw kyakhe phua thuasah, looh thuasah, koiisahkupaw ccangkhakheit thuasah ato lawkute na koiisakuh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Exo 22.25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lev 25.36-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:7-11">Deu 15.7-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Ramccangpaw na koisahkunaw kya ato na lah kho, thuasalama ccou khylan na tee vae cih paw ram kya na cyipaw balyn kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh hythua ae pya nawlan, na uno Israel ccungccaw kya ato lante na koiisahku kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kya byakinkunaw na rae ze, tuh-e ccingsah lanpaw kha accyh na nue lan khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh solei ae ngia cih zah, seinaw mee kha na ingsei cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:1-16">Nam 30.1-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat 5.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama byakinkunaw na rae khyh ze, seinaw mee kha na ing lan khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan na khalang te lungthote bya na kinku vae hawte, na khalang nynh a ho vae paw kha zuakute na cyih hahe cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na innpaw kya-e misu khokhu lang na tee ze, misu thae kha na rythyte phe byn lan na ae kho, thuasalama suaa kya ccapyh san na sangkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na innpaw kya-e athadynpaw ccathae hae laku lang na ccia ze, na kuih te na zuukuh kho, thuasalama na innpaw kya-e athadynpaw ccathae kha rungkou te na awkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zuvaw Tangnaw te Myakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pise lu kheit nynh zu hoi zah, nopinung tungvaw nawccaw leinaw ccangkhakheit a muih keiccuze a lungccing khyh, tukeiccuze myakunawpaw ccaw zeite nopinung a kuih kya pya zah a inn kyate a cciasah; oute nopinung nynh tuh-e pisepaw inn kha cciataw zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5.31</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:7">19.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />ccangpaw pise zu lang a tang. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute lu ningnaw pisepaw nynh tuh-e nopinung tuh ry khyh zah, myakunawpaw ccaw zeite a kuih kya pya zah, a inn kyate a cciasah ze thuasah, lu ningnaw pisepaw tuh a chi ze thuasah, <verse number="4" style="v" />a la cciasahtupaw masaty e a vawpaw nynh a thusah vae paw tuh-e nopinung kha a zu lang dykuh thui vae lan khyh; pawccecize tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang anungsikuhpaw thua zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang seinaw kha na thuakhae lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Upadi Aphuinphuin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zu a hoi thawpaw pisepaw tuh rhawtuk lan cceih lan khyh, tuh-e ryalaw te asekuhpaw ccangkhakheit kya mah naw thua lan khyh. A dykupaw a zu ryte lungpawte umkheih khylan kum kheit lungkhu a rythyte innvaw a um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah sungmia-lung thuasah, sungmia-lung avawlan e lung thuasah aamahkhan lante a ponpaw kha kyngpah lan khyh, pawccecize tuh-e tuh ccungccaw hiinnaw kha ponpaw lante kyngpyapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a uno Israel ccungccaw kha ruh zah, see lang a mang ze thuasah, a zua ze thuasah nybia athua lanze, a ruhtupaw tuh a chih cih. Tuhcite hoyleinaw kha nanning laku kyate na ccikan cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:16">Exo 21.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaethya ccinaw apopaw kha myarya raeringkute thungkhawkuh oh; Levi phin ranpibawi hae kha kaw ka pya hae hawte, minmin nynh ae hopya oh paw miakaw kha hoyte na zui cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:1-14:54">Lev 13.1—14.54</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip ram kyate na ccianaw oh laanryng khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh Miriam tungvaw a cyipaw kha liathui oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Nam 12.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nae innpaw kya hankhakheit na koiisahku ze, aamahkhan lante ae pyapaw kha lawku khylan a inn lungkhu lang na tee lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.10-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:26-27">Exo 22.26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Na koiisahkupaw ccungccaw nynh aamahkhan lante ae pyapaw uccaw yn poukhae lyakhe atolang khe na ngaw cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh a ryachi lanze, aamahkhan lante ae pyapaw boeining kya na ih lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Na innpaw tuh a boeining kya ih zah nang kha hythua ae pya ccaw, aamahkhan uccaw kha khuanin a ccaw maw bua na pya cih; tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia malang na hanlan dingnaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae ram kya-e nae khua khuakhakheit kya umpaw nae uno Israel hae thuasah, ramccang hae thuasah a ryachi hae paw te ahoboupaw ryalahtu hae kya-e mih ryalaw mee kha na ling lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih ryalaw mee kha nin takyhte khuanin ccaw maw na pya cih oh, pawccecize minmin tuh ryachi hae thua hae zah, mih ryalaw mee te nynh mih vue a kuaku hae; tuhkhyhze tuh minmin nynh nanning rawsete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a sia cih hae zah, seinaw mee kha na ingsei cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih ccaaw hae hanlan nungpaaw hae kha chia thua lan khyh hae, nungpaaw hae hanlan ccaaw hae kha mah chia thua lan khyh hae; mimaw seinaw hanlan rou nynh chia athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:6">2Si 14.6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 25:4">2Sh 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Eze 18.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ramccang ccungccaw kya thuasah, ngawraw kya thuasah byadingpaw kha na zosahpah lan khyh; nomaenung boeining kha aamahkhan uccaw lante na lawkuh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:9">Exo 23.9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lev 19.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">Deu 27.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Izip ram kya see lang na la tang oh paw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh tuin kyate ae shawkhaw oh paw kha liathui oh; tukeiccuze hynh-e hynh zui lan kaw kae pya oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae loo kya looh na rue oh zah loo kya na ning oh paw ccavui cce kheit kha law khylan na kinua vae lan khyh oh; tuh-e tuh ramccang ccungccaw, ngawraw te nomaenung hanlan nungsya athua cih, tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh na cyi oh paw balyn kya hythua ae pya cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.19-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lev 19.9-10</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:22">23.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Nae oliv thae kha he na lo oh te, na me oh paw alaepaw kha lothui nan vae oh; tuh-e tuh ramccang ccungccaw, ngawraw te nomaenung hanlan athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nae misu khokhu kya-e misu thae kha he na lo oh te, ccamua kha lothui nan vae oh; tuh-e tuh ramccang ccungccaw, ngawraw te nomaenung hae hanlan athua cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Izip ram kya see lang na la tang oh paw kha liathui oh; tukeiccuze hynh-e hynh zui lan kaw kae pya oh.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu ning tuh byalung hae zah a kaethekuh hae, te byapiatu hae nynh minmin laku byapia hae zah, lu kheit kha dansah hae zah lu kheit kha a seisah hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aseipaw kha bua khylan a phia hae ze, byapiatu nynh tuh-e paw tuh a muihnaw kyakhe a bakhungsah cih zah, a seinaw thyhte bua lan accan zeihte a buasah cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Vae sung pali cia buasah kho athua, tuh lae alung lan buasah kho thua vae khyh; tuh lae alung lan bua athua lanze nae uno tuh nae muihnaw kya a minpousei cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2Ko 11.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccatan a tin cciamangpaw tangnuapaw mung kha na bucceih lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:9">1Ko 9.9</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ti 5.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Innbyn lungkhu Zuvaw Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pynkheihlan um hae paw u te neitaw hae kyaze lukhakheit nynh ccaaw hoi leite a chi lanze, achihpaw zu tuh milae zu lang tangsah thua lan khyh. A vawpaw uno nynh a cceih cih zah zu lang a umkhae cih, te tuh-e nopinung hanlan vawpaw ryalaw kha a lawpah cih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat 22.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:19">Mar 12.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:28">Luk 20.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />a upaw min tuh Israel phin kyate azo khyh nawlan, masaty a saahpaw ccatawccaw tuh achihpaw a upaw ccelang ria athua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e pisepaw nynh a upaw kya-e nomaenung kha zu lang a ry khyh ze, a upaw kya-e nomaenung nynh koikua kya um hae paw piccan hae kalan a cceihthung cih zah, “Ka vawpaw neitaw nynh a upaw min kha Israel phin kya zungzae tynsah ry khyh; kamaw hanlan vawpaw te uno ryalaw kha yn lawpah khyh,” cite a hopah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.7-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:7-8">Rut 4.7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh a khua kya-e piccan hae nynh pisepaw kha a ko cih hae zah a hopah cih hae. Aning nynh, “Amaw kha zu lang ka ry khyh,” cite phe a ei zetuh, <verse number="9" style="v" />a upaw zu nynh piccan hae malang khe tuh-e pisepaw kha a ccianua cih zah, a ccu kya-e phanah kha a khahpah cih zah, a mae kha a thoi cih, te aning nynh, “E hynh a upaw inn a sakpah ry leipaw pisepaw tungvaw cyipaw nynh thua,” cite a ho cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />A inn tuh, “A phanah khahpya athuapaw pisepaw inn,” cite Israel hae kya ny athua vae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawpyanaw Aphuinphuin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pise hae lu kheit te lu kheit dyykuh hae zah, lu kheitpaw zu nynh he a phia hae tuh, a dyykuh hae paw nynh ccavyng a kyngpaw a vawpaw kha pankhaw khylan a kuih dyngte tuh-e pisepaw e kha a kyng lanze, <verse number="12" style="v" />tuh-e nopinung kuih kha thoh na pae cih oh; ngaethya na umsah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae sohrae kya adihpaw te alepaw khinlung phuin ning na hoi lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.13-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:35-36">Lev 19.35-36</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae inn kya adihpaw te alepaw tounawpaw phuin ning na hoi lan khyh oh. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kya nae hiinshe asae nawlan, accingpaw te ahmepaw khinlung kyalya kha na hoi cih oh zah, accingpaw te ahmepaw tounawpaw kyalya kha na hoi cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize tuhcihaw uccaw a cyihpaw balyn, ahme lei lante a cyihpaw balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan anungsikuhpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izip ram kyate na ccianaw oh laanryng kya Amalek nynh nae tungvaw a cyipaw kha thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.17-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Exo 17.8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2-9">1Sa 15.2-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />nanning tuh nae thawthang zah he na bang oh te, laanpi kya aebua oh zah, nae nulang nyathyapaw balyn kha pong a chia hae cipaw kha thuasah liathui oh; aning nynh Pachia kha rih khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae rhaw hae balyn kuih kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ccou khylan ae pya cih oh paw ram kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh haeungnaw he ae pya oh te, Amalek liathuinaw kha vaawlui zakaw kyate phe na thee cih oh; tuh-e tuh la ning nan oh.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thaety te Pumhaw Pumkheit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh rho lang ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang teete na ccou oh zah, tuin kya he na um oh te, <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kyate na rue oh paw laephi athae balyn kya-e thaety aphuinphuin kha na lah cih oh, te suaa lungkhu na sang cih oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a min a um nawlan a po cih paw hmin kalan na cciakhae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Exo 23.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze rya a lahpaw ranpibawi kalan na cceih cih oh zah, amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaening pya lan, kae minpaaw hae kya bya la kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang atunin kaening kae thua vae cipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan kae thaesah,” cite na hopah cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ranpibawi nynh nae kuih kyate suaa kha lah zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia silawhang malang khe he a nya te, <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe hynhcite na hopah cih oh: “Ka minpaaw tuh a khiavuikuhpaw Aram minphuinpaw nynh thua, Izip ram lungkhu lang cceihbung zah, tuin kyakhe milu beihtaraw te ramccang ccungccaw lante a la um, te tuin kyakhe athungpaw te milu alungpaw, minphuin lepaw lang a tang. <verse number="6" style="v" />Izip hae nynh kaening kha ryalaw arupaw lawsahte, oun reih hae zah, riathaenaw he oun pya hae tuh, <verse number="7" style="v" />kae minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan khe kae sia; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae roi kha thae zah, kae riathaenaw, kae thawbangnaw te oun tuaasahnaw hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaening kha athungpaw kuih te a dyngpaw kuih khate thuasah, ri lan umpaw huhan te thuasah, muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw hae te thuasah Izip ram kyate oun poukhae; <verse number="9" style="v" />te hynh-e hmin kalan oun cciakhae zah mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram, hynh-e ram hynh oun pya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang nynh nae pyapaw laephi athae kya-e thaety hynh atu kae thuakhae,” na cipah cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe sua kha na nya cih oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe na bakhung cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning te nae innbyn hae ae pya oh paw hoynaw balyn khate, nanning te nanning laku a um hae paw Levi phin hae te ramccang hae ryte lungtuanaw kha na raekuh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pumhaw pumkheit pya kum, kum thumnaw kum khe na pousah oh paw kya-e pumhaw pumkheit balyn kha na pya oh zah, Levi phin hae, ramccang hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae nynh nae khua lungkhu khe phe byn lan a ae ccaw hae cite he na pya kou oh te,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:28-29">Deu 14.28-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe hynhte na ho cih oh: “Kaw nae pyapaw na kawbya balyn thyhte, athyaapaw pumhaw pumkheit kha ka inn kyate ka poukhae zah, Levi hae, ramccang hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae kha ka pya vae hae; na kawbya miakaw kha ka ei khyh zah ka ning khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Chizo lyakhe pumhaw pumkheit kha ka ae khyh; ka thyaa khyh lyakhe khah-e kha ccapyh san ka nue khyh; te michi hanlan mah khah-e kha ccapyh san ka hlu khyh. Kaw nae pya hawte ka cyih vae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia bya kha ka ngae vae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Athyaapaw na umnaw vaawram te yn dobung lah na ccungccaw Israel hae tungvaw thuasah, kae minpaaw hae kya bya na kinpyaku hae hawte mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram, nae pya vae paw laephi hynh thuasah hythuapyatua,” na cipah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh atunin ccaccei khe phungbya hae te phungzae hae kha zui lan kaw ae pya oh; tukeiccuze nae thinlung balyn te, nae tuanaw balyn te khah-e hae kha zui oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Atunin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nae Pachia lang a tang lanpaw kha thuasah, amaw laanpi kya zuite a phungbya hae, a kawbya hae te a phungzae hae kha zui lanpaw te a bya ngae lanpaw kha thuasah nae nawccah vae. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ae kinpyaku thyh oh hawte, nanning tuh aphutepaw a ccungccaw hae lang tang khylan te a kawbya hae kha zuisah khylan thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Exo 19.5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Deu 4.20</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Pe 2.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />nanning kha a raepaw minphuin balyn luki, thehoysahnaw, minthaannaw te sawtuanaw kya nung khylan thuasah, bya a kinku thyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan athyaapaw minphuin lang tang khylan thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh atunin ae hopya vae oh.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ebal Mua e Lung hae te Beikhang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Moses te Israel piccan hae nynh ccungccaw balyn kha akawlan thyhte a hopya hae: Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw kawbya balyn hynh zui oh. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram lungkhu lang tee khylan Jordan vaw na zua nin oh khe, alepaw lung hae kha na bing cih oh zah, palasta te na naesah cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.2-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:30-32">Jos 8.30-32</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram lang tee khylan vaw kha he na zua kou oh te, hynh-e upadi kya-e bya hae balyn hynh tuh-e lung hae vawlan khe na zei cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhcite Jordan vaw na zua kou oh te, atunin kaw kae pya oh paw lung hae kha Ebal Mua vawlan khe na bing cih oh zah palasta te na naesah cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan sivaw zunghe mang leite lung silawhang ccangkheit kha na rae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Exo 20.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan aw leipaw lung hae khate silawhang kha na raepah cih oh. Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan maee-ute silawnaw kha tuh-e silawhang vawlan khe rae oh, <verse number="7" style="v" />ccawkunaw silawnaw kha rae oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang lungtuate tuin kyakhe ae oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />E upadi kya-e bya hae hynh lung hae vawlan khe ccaerarih lan na zei cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oute Moses te Levi phin ranpibawi hae nynh Israel hae balyn kyakhe, “Pou Israel, zya dae oh lah, ngaetua oh! Atunin ccaccei maw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia ccungccaw lang na tang vae oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atunin kaw kae pya oh paw a kawbya hae te a phungbya hae kha zuite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha ngae oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thyalawnaw Ccanghaw Lae Ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e nin khe Moses nynh ccungccaw hae kha akawlan thyhte a hopya hae: <verse number="12" style="v" />Jordan vaw he na zua kou oh te, ccungccaw hae kha hythuanaw pya khylan Gerizim Mua vawlan a thadyn cih hae paw tuh: Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issakhar, Josef, te Benjamin nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Deu 11.29</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Jos 8.33-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te thyalawnaw hanlan Ebal Mua vawlan a thadyn cih hae paw tuh: Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan, te Naftali nynh thua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Oute Levi phin hae nynh Israel hae balyn kha roi myarya ccae lante hynhte a thaesah cih hae:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan anungsikuhpaw zohtuh khyhze laeekute raepaw khozi, kuih te raepaw uccaw kha raekuh zah a thuruhkuhpaw ccungccaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” cite a leihru cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Exo 20.4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:17">34.17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lev 19.4</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:1">26.1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Deu 4.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:8">5.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A nung thuasah, a paaw thuasah saw a tua leipaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A innpaw paw loori lungbing kha a nuepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:14">Deu 19.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mitzupaw kha laante lang a cciakhaepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:14">Lev 19.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ramccangpaw, ngawraw te nomaenung kha mang ahme pite sei a phusahpaw tuh thyalaw thua sah,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Exo 22.21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 23:9">23.9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lev 19.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Deu 24.17-18</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A paaw zu kha a ikhaepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah, pawccecize a paaw zu kha a kalyngpya vae,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18.8</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20.11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Deu 22.30</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Sarangpaw phinkhakheit kha a ikhaepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Exo 22.19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:23">Lev 18.23</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:15">20.15</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A paaw ccanung thuasah, a nung ccanung athuapaw a ccianung kha a ikhaepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18.9</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:17">20.17</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A zu nung a ikhaepaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lev 18.17</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:14">20.14</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />“A innpaw paw kha aruh lante a buapaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A sei leipaw ccungccaw chii kha luasah khylan pyaruh kha a lawkuhpaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hynh-e upadi bya hae hynh zui khyh zah a tynsah leipaw tuh thyalaw thuasah,” cite a thaesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3.10</ref></char></note> Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” a ci cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawngaenaw elang Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Lev 26.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Deu 7.12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw a kawbya balyn kha zuakute na zui oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kyalya kha na ngae oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh laephi vaw e minphuin balyn luki ahangnaw khe ae nung cih oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.1-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Deu 11.13-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha na ngae oh zetuh, hynh-e hythuanaw balyn hynh nae tungvaw a thua cih zah na ccou cih oh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua kya hythua na mue cih oh, loo kya hythua na mue cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccaaw hae te thuasah, nae laephi athae te thuasah, nae sahiin-awvaw ataw hae te thuasah, nae vaetua te nae tuutaw hae pungzaenaw te thuasah hythuapya na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae sua te nae sanlou nonnawpaw pakekhupaw kha hythuapya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tee vae oh ze hythuanaw na mue cih oh zah, na pou vae oh ze hythuanaw na mue cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning rawsete ae thonuakuh oh paw nae rhaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae malang khe rhaw a shungsah cih hae; nanning rawsete laanpi ccangkheit kyakhate oun thua cih hae zah, nae malang laanpi ccangsari kyakhate a ccue cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nae ccung-inn kya te na cyi oh paw balyn kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythuanaw kha nae tungvaw khe kaw a pya cih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya cih oh paw ram kyakhe hythua ae pya cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae kha na zui oh zah amaw laanpi kya na ccia oh zetuh, bya ae kinpyaku oh thyhte, athyaapaw amaw ccungccaw lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae tynsah cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min liate ko na thua oh paw kha laephi ccungccaw balyn nynh a muih cih hae zah nanning kha ae rih cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning pya khylan nae minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram kyakhe sisua thuasah, nae ccaaw hae thuasah, nae sahiin-awvaw te nae laephi athae thuasah pataepi a hoipaw lang ae rae cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae ram kya amaw accyh te khuaarawsah khylan te na cyi oh paw balyn kya hythuapya khylan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahoirumpaw a sisuainn, vaawlang kha nae hanlan ae hungpah cih oh. Minphuin patae kha na koiisakuh cih oh, thuasalama nanning nynh minmin kya-e kha na koii lan khyh oh. <verse number="13-14" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae hynh na ngae oh zah, zuakute na zui oh ze thuasah, te ccangpaw pachia hae kha zuite beik khylan atunin kaw kae pya oh paw bya balyn kyate voilang ranglang na maeku khyh oh ze thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha lu lang ae rae cih oh zah, aleihmae lang ae rae lan khyh oh; ahang huanaw kya rou khe na um cih oh zah, ane huanaw kya na um lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawngae leipaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Lev 26.14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama atunin kaw kae pya oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae te phungbya hae kha zuakute zui leite amaw bya kha na ngae khyh oh zetuh, hynh-e thyalawnaw balyn hynh nae tungvaw ae thuanua cih oh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nae khua kya thyalawnaw na tung cih oh, nae loo kya thyalawnaw na tung cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nae sua kya te sanlou nonnawpaw nae pakekhupaw kya thyalaw na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nae ccaaw hae kha thuasah, nae laephi athae kha thuasah, nae vaetua phu te nae tuuphu ataw hae kha thuasah thyalaw athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tee vae oh ze thyalawnaw na tung cih oh, he na pou vae oh ze thyalawnaw na tung cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kamaw kha nae vua oh zah, ahoy leipaw nae cyisahnaw keiccuze, ro na thua oh zah arangte na zo mawlaezung oh, cyi lan na zuaku oh paw atyn-are kyakhe vawsawnaw, bungzounaw, keisukeilae nungkunaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae tungvaw ae sawnua cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning nynh ccou khylan na tee cih oh paw ram kyate ae maemih mawlaezung oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh akaekuh thyapaw alepaw ccinaw kha ae kaesah cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ngoinaw, ngesaw lingpaw ccinaw, phinnaw khate thuasah, myarya sonaw te khuaakannaw thuasah, te khivae keiccu aku chinaw te aphi pou zah aku chinaw khate thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vawsaw ae pya cih oh; tuh-e hae nynh na ro mawlaezung oh ae deehui cih oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nae luki e vaawlui tuh sohin athua cih zah, nae zakaw e laephi tuh sivaw athua cih. <verse number="24" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae ram kya arahpaw khuaa kha laenoi lang a tangsah cih zah, ro na thua mawlaezung oh vaawlui kyate vuiping kyalya kha nae tungvaw khe a ccawsah cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae malang khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rhaw kha ae shungsah cih oh; minmin kha rawsete laanpi ccangkheit kyate na ccianua cih oh zah, minmin malang khe laanpi ccangsari kyate na ccue cih oh. Nanning tuh laephi peenaw balyn kya bungzounaw a thuakhaepaw lang na tang cih oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Nae rhua tuh khivae kya-e pavaw miakaw te laephi kya-e sarangpaw hae hanlan looh athua cih hae zah, tuh-e hae a deetupaw lu kheit sanmah um lan khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na dansaku kho lei oh paw Izip ram e balyh, ving ccinaw, chii ccinaw te laethah khate vawsaw ae pya cih oh. <verse number="28" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngaeenaw, mitmohnaw, te lungmuanaw khate vawsaw ae pya cih oh; <verse number="29" style="v" />mitzupaw nynh mohnaw kya azahku hawte, nanning nynh ninthu pi khe na zahkuh cih oh, thuasalama nae laanpi kha na muihkuh kho lan khyh oh; nae laan nae sui ua lan khyh zah, ae bawm lan oh paw humhung sanmah a um lei lante luadenaw kha na tung cih oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Zu na dy oh zemah milae nynh ae ikhaepah cih oh. Inn na sakku oh zemah na umnah lan khyh oh. Misu khokhu na raeku oh zemah athae kha na ae lan khyh oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Nae vaetua kha nae mitmuihnaw khe a chia hae zemah a saw kha na ae lan khyh oh. Nae lann hae kha nae malang khe luadete a cciakhae cih hae zah, na muethui vae lan khyh oh. Nae tuu hae kha nae rhaw hae kalan pya athua cih hae zah ae bawm lan oh paw humhung sanmah um lan khyh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Nae ccapaw hae te nae ccanung hae kha phang na do lya oh khe, milae kalan pya athua cih hae; minmin kha nae mit te ninlang na do cih oh, thuasalama ccangkhakheit cyi khonawpaw thawzung na hoi lan khyh oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Na ny lei oh paw ccungccaw hae nynh nae laephi kya-e athae te nae ryalaw mee balyn kha a ae cih hae; nanning tuh vawsaw pyanaw te sydenaw kha po na ing cih oh, <verse number="34" style="v" />nae mit nynh a muih cih paw uccaw keiccuze nae lung amuakhaekuh cih. <verse number="35" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae ccukharu te nae ccu kyakhe dansah kho athua leipaw myarya ccihpaw balyh hae kha ae hoisah cih oh zah, nae ccuphe kyate nae lukhy cia apazaekuh cih. <verse number="36" style="v" />Nanning kha thuasah, na hangthungku oh paw siapharan kha thuasah nanning te nae minpaaw hae nynh na ny lei oh paw minphuin kalan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae cciakhae cih oh zah, tuin kyakhe thing te thuasah, lung te thuasah raepaw ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik cih oh. <verse number="37" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae cciakhae cihnaw oh ccungccaw hae laku khe nanning tuh ri lan umpaw, tousenaw phungpaw lang, te dothatheihpaw lang na tang cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ccacii patae kha loo lang na cciakhae oh zemah tungkhipaw nynh a ae keiccuze beihtaraw kyalya kha na rue cih oh. <verse number="39" style="v" />Misu khokhu hae kya misu na ccou cih oh zah na do-oih oh zemah ripaw nynh a ae keiccuze misutui kha na neih lan khyh oh zah athae kha na lokuh lan khyh oh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Nae ram balyn kya oliv ku kha na hoi oh zemah nae oliv thae tuh akhuaku keiccuze oliv chitui kha na thuhkuh lan khyh oh. <verse number="41" style="v" />Ccanung hae te ccapaw hae kha na saahku oh zemah rhaw hae nynh a kyng keiccu hae ze, nae kya-e thua lan khyh hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Nae thingku balyn te nae laephi athae balyn tuh tarue hae nynh a zoukhae cih hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Nanning laku e ramccang hae tuh nanning luki houhouh a hangku thung lya hae khe, nanning tuh houhouh na ccahbung cih oh. <verse number="44" style="v" />Nanning nynh minmin kha koiisahku leite minmin nynh nanning kha ae koiisakuh cih oh; minmin tuh lu athua cih hae zah nanning tuh aleihmae na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh kaw ae pya oh paw kawbya hae te phunglang hae kha zuite amaw bya kha na ngae khyh keiccu oh ze, nanning tuh ro na thua mawlaezung oh, hynh-e thyalawnaw balyn nynh nanning kha deehuite ae phah cih oh zah nae tungvaw accah cih. <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuh-e thyalawnaw hae tuh nanning te nae ciihan hae tungvaw kya muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw lante zungzae a um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Atyn-are he na hoi oh te, lungtuanaw thinlung khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha lungtuate na beik khyh oh, <verse number="48" style="v" />tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae sawnua cih oh paw nae rhaw hae kha vuelaw tuihaw te, boeining lawku leite, atyn-are ahobou lante rya na lawpah cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ae ro mawlaezung oh sivaw taphu kha nae nging kya ae khang cih oh. <verse number="49-50" style="v" />Nanning kha mosipi hawte uingnuaku khylan, mih bya na thae lei oh paw, akum tangpaw kha sawtua leite akum nopaw kha mah thaw a ccih leipaw, thinrianaw mitmae a hoipaw minphuin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh asawnaw, laephi adianaw kyate ae konua cih oh. <verse number="51" style="v" />Nanning na ro mawlaezung oh, tuh-e minphuin nynh nae sahiin-awvaw ataw hae te nae laephi athae kha a ae cih, nanning kha ae ro mawlaezung oh, ccathae, misutui te chitui kha thuasah, nae vaetua pungzaenaw te nae tuu ano hae paw kha thuasah ae cciatawpah lan khyh oh. <verse number="52" style="v" />Nae ram balyn kya umpaw, na doliaku oh paw, ahangpaw te atynpaw nae lungrua hae kha a ting mawlaezung hae, nae khua balyn kha ae koihlu cih oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw ram balyn kya umpaw nae khua balyn kha ae koihlu cih oh. <verse number="53" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae nynh ae koihlu oh zah vawsawnaw kha he ae pya oh tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw, na saahku oh paw nae ccanung hae te nae ccapaw hae saw kha na ae cih oh. <verse number="54" style="v" />Nanning laku e ozia anepaw te asung-epaw pise nynh a uno hae, a pompaw a zu te nyathya a hiinhypaw a ccaaw hae tungvaw hysah lan khyh zah, <verse number="55" style="v" />aning nynh a ae cciamangpaw a ccaaw hae saw kha heize ccapyh san pyabua lan khyh hae, pawccecize nae rhaw hae nynh nae khua balyn kha koihlute vawsaw ae pya cih keiccu oh ze, amaw hanlan pawpaw mah umlae vae khyh. <verse number="56" style="v" />Nanning lakuze myaryamaw a ozia ne zah a sung-e keiccuze a ccuphe te laephi a sy ngan leipaw, ozia anepaw te asung-epaw nopi nynh a pompaw a vawpaw tungvaw thuasah, a ccanung tungvaw thuasah, a ccapaw tungvaw thuasah looh kha hysah lan khyh zah, <verse number="57" style="v" />nae khua hae kha rhaw nynh koihlu hae zah, ae lanpaw pawpaw mah a um vae khyh keiccuze a saahpaw a ccaaw hae te a phae te a phae laku kyate a poupaw a lang kha heize aruh lante a ae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:28-29">2Si 6.28-29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Raw 4.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hynh-e aphu-epaw te ri lan umpaw min, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia rhaw kha ri leite, hynh-e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw hynh-e upadi kya-e bya hae balyn hynh zuakute na zui khyh oh zetuh, <verse number="59" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh naemaw te nae ciihan hae tungvaw kya le zah zungzae teingpaw vawsawnaw, le zah zungzae teingpaw ccinaw kha a ccawsah cih. <verse number="60" style="v" />Na ri oh paw Izip ram e ccinaw balyn kha nae tungvaw bua a thuasah cih zah, tuh-e ccinaw hae nynh nanning kya a bahkuh cih hae. <verse number="61" style="v" />E upadi ccauh kya azeikuh leipaw ccangpaw ccinaw te vawsawnaw miakaw kha nanning ro na thua mawlaezung oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae tungvaw a ccawsah cih. <verse number="62" style="v" />Vaawlui e awsi zeih na la lung oh zemah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha na ngae khyh keiccu oh ze, beihtaraw kyalya nynh na um vae cih oh. <verse number="63" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hoynaw ae raepyanaw oh kya te ae pungzaesahnaw oh kya a lungtuakhaeku hawte, nanning rosahnaw kya te zosahnaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a lungtuakhaekuh cih; ccou khylan na teenua oh paw ram kyate nanning kha ae maemih cih oh. <verse number="64" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha laephi voikheit lang te voikheit lang cia ccungccaw balyn laku kya ae pazaesakuh cih oh; tuin kyakhe nanning te nae minpaaw hae nynh na la ny boi lei oh paw, thing te thuasah, lung te thuasah raepaw ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik cih oh. <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuh-e minphuin hae laku kya nae thawdang lan khyh zah, nae ccuphe hanlan haeungnaw mah um lan khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh lungriathaenaw, mit thawzyanaw te lungthawthangnaw kha ae pya cih oh. <verse number="66" style="v" />Nae hiinnaw tuh thinphangnaw te a um zungzae cih; nae hiinnaw tuh aamahkhan um leite khuazi khuadae rikawte na um cih oh. <verse number="67" style="v" />Nae thinlung nynh a ripaw te nae mit nynh a muihpaw keiccuze, awkhua ccyh vae ze, “Zete myng thua ravo nyn,” na ci cih oh zah, zete ccyh vae ze, “Awkhua myng thua ravo nyn,” na ci cih oh. <verse number="68" style="v" />Na muihthui vae lan khyh oh cite bya kae kinpyaku oh paw laanpi khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha Izip ram lang sanphalung te ae kikhae cih oh; tuin kyakhe naemaw te naemaw kha seenung te seepaw lante nae rhaw hae kalan na zuakuh cih oh, thuasalama a retupaw um lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae ryte Horeb kya a raepaw byakinnaw apiaze, Israel hae ryte Moab ram kya byakinnaw rae khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kalan kaw a pyapaw byakinnaw kya-e bya hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moab kya Byakinnaw Thawsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses nynh Israel hae balyn kha pum hae zah hynhte a hopya hae: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip ram nae mitmuihnaw kya Faro tungvaw thuasah, a see hae balyn kya thuasah, a ram balyn kya thuasah, <verse number="3" style="v" />nae mit nynh muihpaw myarya lepaw syntawnaw hae, muihsahnaw hae te myarya lepaw ngaeangnaw hae balyn kha phe na muih vae oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama thaethya nawlan thinlung, muih nawlan mit, thae nawlan nakaring kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh atunin ae pya vae khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning kha ramkaw kya kum sung pali lungkhu kae cciakhae vae oh. Nae tungvaw e boeining tuh pue khyh zah, nae ccu kya-e phanah mah pue khyh; <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua cipaw na ny nawlan oh, sanlou kha na ae khyh oh zah misutui te ruithyapaw niapaw kha mah na neih khyh oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning nynh hynh-e hmin kya he na thua oh te, Heshbon siapharan Sihon te Bashan siapharan Og nynh aening kha rhawtuk khylan oun pounua hae zemah aening nynh phe ah tae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin ram kha ah lah oh zah Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh kalan khe rho lang ah pya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nam 32.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na cyi oh paw atyn-are kya nae laan nae sui a ua nawlan, hynh-e byakinnaw kya-e bya hae hynh zuakute zui oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atunin nanning tuh nae balynte, nae phin cciakhaetu hae, nae piccan hae, nae bawi hae, Israel pise balyn, <verse number="11" style="v" />nae ccaaw hae, nae nopi hae, nae ryahmin kya umpaw ramccang hae, nae thing a tya hae paw te nae tui a the hae paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia malang khe na thadyn oh, <verse number="12" style="v" />tuh-e na thadyn oh paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning ryte atunin bya a kinkupaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kya-e byakinnaw lungkhu lang tee khylan nynh thua; <verse number="13" style="v" />oute nanning kya te nae minpaaw hae Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya bya a la kinku hawte, nanning hynh a ccungccaw lang tynsah khylan te amaw hynh nae Pachia lang tang khylan nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />E byakinnaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia malang kaening ryte hein kya atunin na thadyn oh paw nanning kyalya te raepaw thua leite, <verse number="15" style="v" />atunin aening kya a umbua lei hae paw ryte mah raepaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Izip ram kya pawtemou ah um oh cipaw te pawtemou minphuin hae laku kya po ah ccia oh cipaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin kya umpaw anungsikuhpaw mih uccaw hae, thing te lung te ngun te sui te raekuhpaw athupaw zohtuh hae kha na muih vae oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hynh-e minphuin hae kya-e pachia hae kha beik khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kyate a thinlung a maeleihkuh vae paw pise thuasah, nopi thuasah, innbyn thuasah, minphuin thuasah nanning laku a um kho. Nanning laku kya sy a hoipaw te akhahpaw tharui apopaw a um kho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Heb 12.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Hynh-e byakinnaw bya kha a thae hae paw balyn nynh mih thinlung kyakhe, “Ka lungkhung thyhte ka ccia zemah ka khyn mamin,” cite a tuaku hae. (Tuh-e nynh nanning ahoypaw te ahoy leipaw balyn kha ae roh cih oh), <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning kha ngaethya lan khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw te eiungnaw tuh aning tungvaw maeekhuh hawte akhuh cih. Hynh-e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw thyalawnaw balyn hynh a tungvaw accah cih zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a min kha vaawlui zakaw kyate a thee cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Hynh-e upadi ccauh kya zeikuhpaw byakinnaw kya-e thyalawnaw balyn thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning kha Israel phin balyn kyate vawsawnaw pya khylan a phia cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Malang she kya, nanning nukhute oun pui cih hae paw nae ccaaw hae te asawnaw ram kyate oun thua hae paw ramccang hae nynh hynh-e ram a ronaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ingsah hae paw vawsawnaw kha a muih cih hae, <verse number="23" style="v" />tuh-e ram balyn tuh kemaee te loi te karae u zah ccacii ccou leinaw, athae thae leinaw te aku po leinaw nynh thua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thinria zah a ropaw Sodom,</para>
  <para style="p">Gomorrah, Admah te Zeboiim ronaw hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Gen 19.24-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />minmin te minphuin balyn nynh, “E ram kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawcce hynhte a cyi? E myarya lepaw thinrianaw hynh paw keiccu mou?” cite mih ngaeang athua cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh, “Izip ram kyate he a poukhae hae te, mih minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin ryte a la raepaw byakinnaw kha a vua keiccu hae nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin nynh maeleihkuh hae zah a la ny lei hae paw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a khee hae paw ccangpaw pachia hae kha a beik hae; <verse number="27" style="v" />tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw nynh tuh-e ram kha maee lang ruanua zah, hynh-e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw thyalawnaw miakaw kha tuh-e ram kya a thuasah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thinrianaw, thinkhykunaw te myarya lepaw bungpawnaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha mih ram kyate dee hae zah, atu acyiku hawte ccangpaw ram lungkhu lang a vua hae,” cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuruhpaw uccaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kya-e nynh thua, thuasalama hynh-e upadi kya-e bya hae balyn hynh zui khylan phy athuapaw uccaw hae tuh zungzaete aening te ah ccaaw hae kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia kya-e Lungzinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nae malang ka nungpaw hynh-e uccaw hae balyn, hythuanaw te thyalawnaw hae hynh nae tungvaw he a cyihkuh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae deenaw oh minphuin hae laku khe tuh-e tuh na nyhthui oh zah, <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan maeleihkute, atunin kaw kae pya oh thyhte, nanning te nae ccaaw hae nynh nae thinlung balyn te, nae tuanaw balyn te amaw bya kha na ngae oh zetuh, <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hoirumnaw kha pyathuite, thaw ae ccih cih oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pazaesahkunaw oh ccungccaw balyn kyate ae sueluathui cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Laephi adianaw cia dee na thua oh zemah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh tuin kyate ae sueluathui cih oh zah, tuin kyate ae kikhae thui cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae nynh la ccou hae paw ram lungkhu langkhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae cciakhae cih oh zah, tuh-e ram tuh na ccou cih oh; nae minpaaw hae laeze a hoi huapaw te a lung huapaw lang ae rae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, nanning hiin khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha nae thinlung balyn te, nae tuanaw balyn te na sungsah oh ccaw cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae thinlung te nae ciihan hae thinlung vingdung kha a aw cih. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hynh-e thyalawnaw balyn hynh nae rhaw hae tungvaw te nanning vawsaw ae pya oh paw tungvaw kyakhe a ccawsah cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute atunin kaw kae pya oh paw a kawbya balyn hynh zuite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na ngaethui cih oh, <verse number="9-10" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh na cyi oh paw balyn kya thuasah, nae ccaaw hae kya thuasah, nae sahiin taw hae kya thuasah, nae laephi athae hae kya thuasah myarya a hoirumpaw lang ae rae cih oh. Nae thinlung balyn te, nae tuanaw balyn te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan na maeleihkuh oh zah, hynh-e upadi ccauh kya azeikuhpaw a kawbya hae te a phunglang hae hynh zuite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha na ngae oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae minpaaw hae hoirumnaw kya a lungrythua hawte, nae hoirumnaw kya a lungrythua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Poku lan Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atunin kaw kae pya oh paw hynh-e kawbya hynh nae hanlan myaryamaw arupaw te myaryamaw asawkuhpaw thua khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kawbya kha ah thae oh zah ah zui nawlan oh, hum nynh mou aening hanlan vaawlui lang a kae cih zah oun lawpah cih?” cite na ho lan oh ciate kawbya tuh vaawlui kya um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.12-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6-8">Rom 10.6-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kawbya kha ah thae oh zah ah zui nawlan oh, hum nynh mou aening hanlan rili khuraw lang oun zuapah cih zah, oun lawpah cih?” cite na ho lan oh ciate kawbya tuh rili khuraw lang um khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Bya tuh nanning te myarya anaekuh; nanning nynh zui khylan nae mung kya te nae thinlung kya nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dotua oh, hiinnaw te hoirumnaw, chinaw te vawsawnaw hynh atunin nae malang ka nung vae. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha sungsahte, amaw laanpi kha na zui oh zah, a kawbya hae, a phunglang hae te a phungzae hae kha zuite atunin kaw kae pya oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya hae hynh na zui oh zetuh, na hiin cih oh zah na pungzae cih oh, te ccou khylan na tee cih oh paw ram kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hythua ae pya cih oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama nae thinlung tuh paleihkute na thae ry khyh oh zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha bakhungnuate beik khylan ae cciakhaesei oh zetuh, <verse number="18" style="v" />na roh cih oh cite atunin kae hopya oh; teenuate ccou khylan Jordan vaw na zuanua cih oh paw ram kya nae hiinshe sae lan khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiinnaw te chinaw, hythuanaw te thyalawnaw kha nanning malang ka nung vae cipaw atunin ccaekia lang vaaw te lae hynh ka ko hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Naemaw te nae ccaaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha sungsahte, a bya na ngae oh zah amaw kha tynkaring lan kyngkute na hiin ccaw oh, hiinnaw kha pokuh oh; pawccecize tuh-e tuh nanning hanlan hiinnaw te hiinshe saenaw nynh thua, tuhteze nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae minpaaw hae Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya pya lan bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram kya na hiin cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Gen 12.7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26.3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moses Ccelang Joshua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Nam 27.12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses nynh e bya hae balyn hynh Israel hae balyn kyakhe he a ho koute, <verse number="2" style="v" />minmin kha hynhte a hopya hae: “Kae hynh atu za kheit kum kuin ka cih vae. Ka pou kho vae khyh zah ka tee kho vae khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, ‘E Jordan vaw hynh na zua lan khyh,’ yn cipya vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Nam 20.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia ccaccei nynh nae malang a cceih cih. Aning nynh hynh-e minphuin hae hynh nanning malang a roh cih hae zah, mih ram kha na luade cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinku vae hawte, Joshua nynh mah nae malang a cceih cih. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Amor siapharan hae Sihon te Og thuasah, mih ram thuasah a ro lyaze, mih tungvaw a la cyi hawte minmin tungvaw a cyih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha nanning kalan ae pya cih oh zah, kae pya oh paw kawbya balyn thyhte mih tungvaw na cyih cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nae thawsae sah lah, nae rawthung sah; rih nan oh lah, thyngkuh nan oh, pawccecize nanning ryte a cceihpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh thua; nanning kha ae cciataw lan khyh oh zah ae vua lan khyh oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oute Israel hae balyn nynh a muihnaw hae khe, Moses nynh Joshua kha ko zah hynhte a hopya: “Na thawsae sah lah, na rawthung sah, pawccecize nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e ccungccaw hae kha pya lan mih minpaaw hae kya bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang minmin ryte a cceih cih paw nynh na thua; ram tuh minmin kha na ccousah cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na malang a cceihpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua. Nang kha ae umkhae cih; nang kha ae cciataw lan khyh zah ae vua lan khyh. Rih nan lah, na lungroh nan sah,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos 1.5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb 13.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Kum Sarinaw takyh Upadi Rianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oute Moses nynh hynh-e upadi hynh zei zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua a puihtu hae Levi ccapaw hae ranpibawi hae te Israel piccan hae balyn kha a pya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses nynh minmin kha, “Kum sarinaw kum takyh, accyh khyapaw ngaethyakunaw kum, bu poi tua lyakhe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:1">Deu 15.1</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">16.13-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a po cih paw hmin kyakhe Israel balyn tuh amaw malang langku khylan he a thua hae te, e upadi hynh Israel balyn malang a thaenaw hae khe na riapah cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pise hae, nopi hae, imua hae te nae khua hae kya a um hae paw ramccang hae nynh a thae cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw rithyanaw kha a ccangkuh cih hae zah, hynh-e upadi kya-e bya hae balyn hynh zuakute a zui ccaw hae, ccungccaw hae kha pum hae, <verse number="13" style="v" />tuhteze nynh hynh-e upadi a nyh loh leipaw mih ccaaw hae nynh a thae cih hae zah, ccou khylan Jordan vaw na zuanua cih oh paw ram kya na hiin lungkhu oh balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw rithyanaw kha a ccangkuh cih hae,” cite kaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha, “Na chinaw ccyh anae vae; Joshua kha ryalaw ka pya ccaw, amaw kha ko lah, tungkunaw bu kyakhe um oh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Moses te Joshua nynh cceih hae zah tungkunaw bu kya a um hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh bu kya maeking tung kyakhe yn langkuh; maeking tung tuh bu thuakaw kya a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha, “Aro mawze nang tuh na minpaaw hae ryte na ihkheih vae cih oh. Tetuh hynh-e ccungccaw hae nynh a ccianua hae paw ram kya-e pachia hae, minmin laku kya umpaw ramccang hae kya-e pachia hae kyakhe mimaw te mimaw ohhuakunaw kha a tho vae cih hae; minmin ryte ka raepaw ka byakinnaw kha rote kae kha yn vua cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e nin khe minmin tungvaw ka thinrianaw tuh maee lang arua cih. Minmin kha ka vua cih hae zah minmin kyate ka mitmae kha ka retawkuh cih hae; minmin tuh kyng azoipaw saw hae lang a tang cih hae zah, hoyleinaw te vawsawnaw patae tuh minmin tungvaw accah cih. Tuin nin khe minmin nynh, ‘Ah Pachia tuh aening laku kya a um khyh keiccuze hynh-e vawsawnaw hae hynh aening tungvaw accawpaw thua khyh tou?’ cite a hokuh cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccangpaw pachia hae kalan maekute a cyi hae paw hoyleinaw balyn keiccuze ka mitmae kha ka retawkuh ccaccing cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu hynh-e hlaw hynh zei lah, Israel hae kha ccangpah hae; e hlaw hynh Israel hae konglang te ka ccaekia lang a tang ccaw, mih khalang kya nungpah hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize mih minpaaw hae kya bya ka kinpyaku hae paw, khoilutui te mateitui aluanaw ram lungkhu lang ka teekhae hae zah, phe byn lan ae hae zah he a tho hae te, kae kha saryate ka byakinnaw kha a roh cih hae zah ccangpaw pachia hae kalan maeleihkute a beik cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te ri lan umpaw vawsawnaw patae tuh mih tungvaw he accah te, hlaw tuh mih ciihan hae khalang kyate a zo khyh keiccuze hynh-e hlaw nynh ccaekia lante minmin kha hawiliate a rawse cih hae. Pawccecize bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang ka teekhae maw hae, atumaw heize pawmou cyi lan a paccynku hae cipaw phe ka ny,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh nin ccaccei khe Moses nynh hynh-e hlaw hynh zei zah Israel hae kha a ccangpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Nun ccapaw Joshua kha ryalaw pya zah, “Na thawsae sah lah, na rawthung sah, bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang Israel hae kha na cciakhae cih hae; kae tuh na kya ka um cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:23">Nam 27.23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Jos 1.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses nynh hynh-e upadi kya-e bya hae hynh ccauh kya phe thang lan a zei koute, <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua a puihtu hae Levi phin hae kha kawpya hae zah, <verse number="26" style="v" />“E upadi ccauh hynh lah oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kya-e byakin thingkua pe khe nung oh; nanning konglang te ccaekia lang a um cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning hynh pawcih baban kawngae lei hae paw te lungkhung hae paw cipaw hoyte ka ny vae. Nanning laku ka hiin lya heize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a dou hae paw na thua oh ze, ka chih koute thytuh hohcihmou houh na dou vae cih oh! <verse number="28" style="v" />Nae phin kya-e piccan balyn te nae bawi hae nynh a thaenaw hae khe hynh-e bya hae hynh ka hopah hae zah, minmin konglangte vaaw te lae kha ccaekia lang ka ko ccaw hae, minmin kha kamaw kalan yn pumtua oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize ka chih koute kaw kae pya oh paw laanpi kyate ccanglang na maekuh cih oh zah, hoyleinaw kha na rae mamin cih oh cipaw phe ka ny. Malang ccyh kyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha na rae oh zah, nae kuih ryalawnaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thin na riasah keiccu oh ze, vawsawnaw nynh ae thuanua cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Hlaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Oute Moses nynh hynh-e hlaw kya-e bya hae hynh Israel zapi balyn a thaenaw hae khe hynhte phe thang lan a hopya hae:</para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou vaawlui hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae nakaring kha</para>
  <para style="q1">oun tuaku tua oh, bya ka ho cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi nynh ka khalang kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">bya hae hynh thaesah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ccangpyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hawte rah sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya tuh dangdy hawte ccahsah;</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua vawlan khe khuaaratui hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">anopaw aku hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">pharyphary rahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaa hawte thua vae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thaesah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia a lesaenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysah oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungpi athuapaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalawnaw tuh ccing zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laanpi hae balyn tuh akyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Alungzipaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">a hyn leipaw, ahmepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a dingpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuhzemah arohpaw a ccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tungvaw ahme lei lante a rae vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi a me hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyaruh hae paw minphuin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou mingaee hae te tuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi leipaw ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhcite tou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na pyaru cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning tuh nanning lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ae tangsah oh paw nae paaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ae raetu oh paw te ae tynsah oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Langmaw e nin hae kha liathuitua,</para>
  <para style="q2">alia vae paw kum hynhsepi kha tuatua;</para>
  <para style="q1">na paaw kha khia lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae nysah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na piccan hae kha khia hae lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae hopah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahang Huaccepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih rho nee hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:26">Loc 17.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">he a phia hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae milu alung azya thyhte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae ramri kha a ia hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccoupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw ccungccaw hae kha nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob tuh amaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccoupaw rho nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh Jakob kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">khivae roi accaenaw ccungkia leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kyakhe a muih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob kha a thungkhaw, a do-oih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a mitlungdy hawte phang a rin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosipi nynh a bu kha hy zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a taw luki khe a zou bungthung;</para>
  <para style="q1">a sake kha daw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a taw hae kha lawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sake khate ahangnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a zoukhae hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> makhae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob kha a cciakhae; amaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang pachia um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laephi ahangnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin hae kyakhe nung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">loo kyate apoupaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">aepaw a dang;</para>
  <para style="q1">Lungpi kya-e khoitui khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rihlung kya-e chitui khate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha a do-oih,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaetua phu kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">samateitui ahaawpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">tuuphu kya-e mateitui,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutaw tho te tuutepaw tho,</para>
  <para style="q1">Bashan ram e tangnuapaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">miaatepaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoypaw chanvuih ryte na ae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae chiise kha na nia.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jakob tuh phe byn lan a ae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jeshurun tuh yn thobaleih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccu te a sy.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na tho, na ngesaw abeih,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ngesaw anae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Tetuh a raetupaw Pachia kha vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khumnaw Lungpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh ramccang</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hae khate amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">eiungnaw a hoisah hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinriasah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">thua leite, raerangsaro hae kalan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:20">1Ko 10.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">nae minpaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ri lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">athaw oun thua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ny lei hae paw pachia hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">si a law hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang lang ae tangsahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Lungpi kha pawlang na ria khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae saahtupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kha na ning.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">he a muih te, a thinria zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccapaw hae te a ccanung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a vua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Minmin kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mitmae ka retawkuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin athangnaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou athua cih cipaw ka do cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccouseikuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ciihan nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">zyn lan um leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">athua leipaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">eiungnaw yn hoisah hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:22">1Ko 10.22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom 10.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">mih zohtuh hae khate</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thin yn riasah hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tukeiccuze minphuin</para>
  <para style="q1">athua leipaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">eiungnaw ka hoisah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">angaeepaw minphuin khate</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thin ka riasah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize ka thinrianaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee kha ruasah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Akhunaw michi khua</para>
  <para style="q2">Sheol lang cia a u;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi te laephi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pousahpaw kha u zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua aleihpaw hae kha a u.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mih tungvaw kya ronaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka pum cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin rawsete ka the hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mangnua cih hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccakannaw a teing cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">asopaw te ukunaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya ccihpaw ccinaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">a chih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Sarepaw hae haw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping kya avawpaw sy</para>
  <para style="q1">a hoi hae paw kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sawnua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laanpi kyaze thaloi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a chisah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">inn lungkhu kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">bungzou thinphangnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a chisah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ccangvae te</para>
  <para style="q2">liaccaw thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">matei zu ungpaw imua te taw zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a sang phe paw vae paw thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">a chih kalang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin kha phiariphiarae nung lan te</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a nynaw hae kyakhate</para>
  <para style="q2">zosah lan ka tuaku;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thuasalama mih rhaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a lysahku lan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinphang,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize mih rhaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thaesei cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Aening kuih nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">hynh-e balyn a cyihtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thua khyh,’ cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a ho cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin tuh tuanaw a hoi lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyhthya lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A haw hae paw athua hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh a nyhthya cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">athangnaw ccyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou acyihkuh cih</para>
  <para style="q2">cipaw a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih Lungpi nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zua hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw a shungsah khyh hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit nynh ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thong kheit kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou a dee kho cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lu ning nynh thong haw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou a ccuesah kho cih hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mih lungpi tuh aening Lungpi te</para>
  <para style="q2">lokuh ccaccing khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aening rhaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mingaee hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin kya-e misu akaran hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Sodom kya-e misu akaran kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Gomorrah misu khokhu kyate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua hae paw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih misu thae hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sy a hoipaw misu thae hae nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih misu ange hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">akhah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mih misutui tuh hupaw sy,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">huparepaw sy nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />E hynh kamaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccakhung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sisua bawng kya minkhiate</para>
  <para style="q2">a umpaw thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Liarunaw te amee sangrunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw kya-e nynh thua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12.19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Heb 10.30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize accyh zaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccu tuh athei cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih vawsawnaw nin tuh nae vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin ronaw tuh arangte yn thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mih huhan tuh thang vae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.36a: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:14">Sam 135.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">heedepaw ccungccaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">aluepaw ccungccaw um vae khyh hae</para>
  <para style="q2">cipaw he a nyh te,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a see hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccinaw a hoi cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaa a ccousah ccaccing cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Oute aning nynh: Mih pachia hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khynnaw hae paw lungpi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hum nynh mou si a lawnaw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">atho kha ae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">si a lawnaw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui kha a neih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e hae nynh thokuh hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae bawm oh sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh nanning thungkhawtu</para>
  <para style="q2">thua hae sah!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Atu nytua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw rou hynh nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">Kamaw laelan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw pachia um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka theih zah ka hiinsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaemaw ka muesah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka dansah; ka kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn lua kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawccecize ka kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang ka hangthung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hynhcite bya ka kinku:</para>
  <para style="q2">Zungzae hiinpaw ka thua thyhawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Dalahdalah akpaw ka thaloi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he ka taw te, ka kuih nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">byapianaw kha ccavyng a kyng;</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae yn rhawtu hae paw tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">liarunaw ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn hua hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A sang saepaw rhaw lu kyate,</para>
  <para style="q2">chia athua hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">kyng athua hae paw chiise khate</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka the hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">chiise ka ruisah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaloi nynh saw a ae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pou minphuin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thehoysah oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:10">Rom 15.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:2">Bya 19.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hae nanning balyn,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha beik oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize a ccaaw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">chiise phu kha a lah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rhaw hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw a rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a hua hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a liaru cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kha a thyaasah cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses tuh yn thua zah Nun ccapaw Joshua ryte hynh-e hlaw kya-e bya balyn hynh ccungccaw hae a thaenaw hae kyakhe a hopya hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Moses nynh hynh-e bya balyn kha Israel hae balyn kya a hopah kou hae te, <verse number="46" style="v" />minmin kha, “Atunin nanning te arawsekuhte ccaekia kae khanpyaku oh paw hynh-e bya balyn hynh nae thinlung kya ccykekuh oh; e kawbya kya-e bya balyn hynh nae ccaaw hae nynh zuakute a zui nawlan hae, minmin kha kawbya hawte pya oh. <verse number="47" style="v" />E hynh nanning hanlan huatawpaw uccaw thua khyh, thuasalama nae hiinnaw ccaccing nynh thua; hynh-e liate ccou khylan Jordan vaw na zuanua cih oh paw ram kya nae she asae cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Chinaw Hotynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuh-e nin ccaccei khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha akawlan e thyhte a hopya:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.48-52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Nam 27.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Deu 3.23-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="49" style="v" />“Jeriko khua araw lang, Moab ram lungkhu Abarim muazung hae kya umpaw Nebo Mua lang kaethung lah, Israel hae nynh a pee lan hae ka pya cih hae paw Kanaan ram kha dotua; <verse number="50" style="v" />na upaw Aaron tuh Hor Mua vawlan chih zah a puizia hae kalan sueluabua athua hawte, na kaepaw mua vawlan khe na chih cih zah, na puizia hae kalan sueluabua na thua cih; <verse number="51" style="v" />pawccecize nanning parouh mawte Zin ramkaw, Meribah-kadesh tui kya Israel hae laku khe ka tungvaw zynnaw kha na rosah zah, Israel hae laku kya athyaapaw lante ka saw nae tua khyh oh. <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel hae ka pya cih hae paw ram kha asawnaw kyate na muih zemah, khah-e ram lungkhu lang na tee lan khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel hae Nyathya Moses Hythua Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hynh Pachia ccungccapaw Moses nynh a chi mawkhe Israel hae hythua a pya hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses nynh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Sinai mua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Seir kyate aening tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin lang yn thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Paran Mua kyate yn aw.</para>
  <para style="q2">Amaw ryte mithyaa</para>
  <para style="q1">thong haw a umbua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">A ranglang kuih kya</para>
  <para style="q2">aruapaw maee a ccyng.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungsah ccaccing hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a mithyaa hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuih kya a um hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze amaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpyanaw kha lawkute,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccunoh kha a zui hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses nynh upadi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob phin zapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pee lan yn pya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccaw cciakhaetu hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel phin balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan he a sueluakuh hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Jeshurun kya</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben tuh a ccungccaw azya zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hiinsah lah, chih nan sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Judah kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Judah roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaepya tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhae tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw hanlan a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawsaesah tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rhaw hae dounaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">bawmtu thuatua,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Levi kong kha:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:7">Exo 17.7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 28:30">28.30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:13">Nam 20.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“Na Thummim te na Urim kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Massah kya na syntawtuapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Meribah tui kya na rawsepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">alungzipaw na ccungccapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Levi kalan pyatua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuh-e ccungccapaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Minmin kha pawlang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ria khyh hae,’ cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a nung te a paaw kong kha a ho;</para>
  <para style="q1">a puizia hae kha peki khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae kha nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize na bya kha ngae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na byakinnaw kha a tynsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin nynh Jakob phin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na phungzae a ccangpah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel phin kha na upadi</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccangpah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">mynkhuhpaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na silawhang kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">maee-ute silawnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">abalyn kha thuasah a nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a sisua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuapya lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih ryalawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoupya tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a hua hae paw a rhaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">bua a thoku khyh ccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih cce kha khyatua hae,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a sungsahpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kyakhe khyndadyh lan a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahangpaw Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha ninlang thungkhaw zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a raw te a raw laku khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a umsah,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Josef kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“A ram tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liate,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangnaw vaawram kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoypaw lasung hae khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akhunaw e akawlankou</para>
  <para style="q2">umpaw khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khuanin liate apoupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thae hoypaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">sawpaw liate apoupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />langmawlya te a la umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae nynh a pousah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy huapaw khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw mua hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">athae hoypaw patae khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />laephi kya-e ahoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lasung hae te laephi nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a pousahpaw aphuinphuin khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Sinai mua vawlan a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">phungbaryh kya-e sungsah</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccinaw khate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">hythuanaw muesah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Hynh-e hae hynh a upaw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">laku kya bawi athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Josef lu vawlan thua hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangnuapaw thanty tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lesaenaw hoi zah, a ki hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">saccung ki nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e a ki hae khate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi athangnaw cia</para>
  <para style="q1">a dia cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae tuh Efraim ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thong haw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae tuh Manasseh ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athong-asan hae nynh thua,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou Zebulun, khua na ccongnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungtua sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Issakhar, na bu lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mua lang ko hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kyakhe ahmepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">silawnaw hae kha a rae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize rili hoirumnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia kya-e thuruhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">sisua kha minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccou hae,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Gad kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Gad a pungzaesahtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysah thuasah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Gad tuh chindeih hawte nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh kuihbaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">lukhy kha a pae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh amaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy huaccepaw kha a poku,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize tuin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhaetu nynh a ccou lanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw hanlan taekhiate</para>
  <para style="q2">nungpya athua; ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhaetu hae kalan yn thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e dingnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a phungzae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae hanlan a rae,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Dan kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dan tuh Bashan kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thohkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih anopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nynh thua,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Naftali kong kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q2">sungsah thawccinaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">lungryccing khaekuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e hythuanaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">phe beihpaw niccaw lang te</para>
  <para style="q2">alia lang kha ccoutua,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Asher kong kha hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Asher tuh ccapaw hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw a ccou huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nynh thua, a uno hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungsahua hae paw thuasah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccu tuh chitui lungkhu dung sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na pangccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw te sohin thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Na hiin lungkhu na thawzung um sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pou Jeshurun, nang bawm khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">lesaenaw te phe beih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui a ccikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia tahawpaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zungzae hiinpaw Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na umnaw hmin nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang bawm khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw kuihbaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te na rhaw hae kha na malang te</para>
  <para style="q2">sakhia hae zah, “Roh oh!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khyndadyh lan a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui nynh vuiraw a ccawsahnaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccathae te misutui alungnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kya umpaw Jakob a umnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou Israel, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuapaw nynh na thua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a khumpaw ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning tuh nang ae bawmtu</para>
  <para style="q1">khawriaphua thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na taenawpaw thaloi nynh thua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Na rhaw hae tuh maemuihtangte</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan oun thua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ke kha na syde cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moses Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Moses tuh Moab bialae kyate Jeriko khua arawlang umpaw Nebo Mua, Pisgah mua dung langkhe a cceihthung, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ram balyn kha a muihsah: Gilead ram kha Dan kyacia, <verse number="2" style="v" />Naftali abalyn, Efraim te Manasseh ram, Judah ram balyn kha Niccaw lang e Rili kyacia, <verse number="3" style="v" />Negeb ram, te Bialae athuapaw ungcci ku khua cikuhpaw Jeriko khua kya-e accya te Zoar kyacia. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha, “E ram hynh Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya, ‘Nae ciihan hae kalan ka pya cih hae,’ cite bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram nynh thua; Na mit te kae muihsah vae, thuasalama khuhlang raw na zua lan khyh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Gen 12.7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26.3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> seepaw Moses tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pyanaw Moab ram khe a chih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses tuh Beth-peor araw lang, Moab ram accya khe a uu hae, thuasalama a uunaw hae hmin kha atunin cia hum nynh sanmah nyh khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses tuh za kheit kum kuin a cih te a chih; a mitmoh khyh zah a thawzung mah zyabung khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Moses hanlan Moab bialae kya nin sung thum rawkhuite a um hae; oute Moses hanlan rawkhuinaw ccyh tuh athang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses nynh a kuih kha Nun ccapaw Joshua tungvaw a la khang vae keiccuze, Joshua tuh hawnaw muisaw te phe a beih; Israel hae nynh Joshua bya kha ngae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kaw a la pya hawte a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mitmae hawiliakute a nypaw Moses tahawpaw profeh tuh Israel hae kya kharouh langkuh boi khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Exo 33.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha saw zah, Izip ram kya um hae paw Faro te a see hae balyn te a ram kya-e ccungccaw balyn kyakhe muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw balyn kha a rae hawte ccangpaw profeh nynh rae boi khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses nynh Israel hae balyn mitmuihnaw kya a cyipaw athawsaepaw huhan te le zah ri lan umpaw cyisahnaw hae balyn hawte a cyih khopaw ccangpaw profeh um boi khyh.</para>
</usx>